window.FWN_MARTIAL_GOD_ASURA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MARTIAL_GOD_ASURA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":6701,"title":"Chapter 6701: Chapter 6699: Netherworld Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 6699: Netherworld Master","“Hold on. You two can have your touching reunion later. Answer my question first. Dongfang Hansong, what’s with the talk about the Netherworld Master and calling me young master?” Chu Feng asked.","He was inclined to believe that Chen Hui was indeed Dongfang Hansong’s son, but he was more curious about what the latter was going on about.","Dongfang Hansong stood up and took out two bloodline auras that fused impeccably together. Chu Feng sensed incredible familiarity from the two bloodline auras.","“It’s all thanks to Lord Netherworld Master that our Netherworld Sect enjoys its current prosperity, but so far, no one knows about Lord Netherworld Master’s true identity.","“Cang Li had the fortune of seeing his side profile, and he says that you bear a striking resemblance to him. Moreover, your Netherworld Embryo is unusually strong, and you have shown exceptional control over the sacred item. Considering that, Lord Cang Li suspected that you are Lord Netherworld Master’s descendant.","“To verify that, Lord Cang Li suffered a huge backlash to extract a sliver of Lord Netherworld Master’s bloodline aura from his body. He ordered me to head to your hometown, the Great Chiliocosm Upper Realm, to seek your grandfather’s bloodline aura to see if the two are the same.","“And I have verified that your missing grandfather, Chu Hanxian, is the very same Lord Netherworld Master who ushered in an age of prosperity for our Netherworld Sect,” Dongfang Hansong declared.","This news came as a huge blow to the trio present.","“My grandfather... is the Netherworld Master?”","Chu Feng was shocked, but he quickly recalled the words from that mysterious old man he had met back then, and everything seemed to click.","He had once stumbled into an enigmatic place and met a mysterious old man who had survived from the Ancient Era. For some reason, that old man addressed Chu Feng as young master[1].","From the old man, he learned some things about his grandfather.","Chu Hanxian had been an incredible prodigy who alarmed the Ancestral Martial Starfield’s powerhouse, the Wuming Clan. The Wuming Clan would not permit anyone to threaten their position, so they sent their men to assassinate Chu Hanxian.","Chu Hanxian survived the ordeal, but he wasn’t strong enough to deal with the Wuming Clan then. So, he left the Ancestral Martial Starfield to escape the Wuming Clan’s surveillance, with the intention to return and usher his clan to prosperity once he became stronger.","By a stroke of coincidence, Chu Hanxian stumbled into that enigmatic place and spent many years there—possibly an entire nine thousand years. It was only a thousand years ago that his grandfather finally left that enigmatic place.","However, he didn’t return to the Chu Heavenly Clan.","The mysterious old man said that his grandfather had something he needed to do. He had assured Chu Feng that his grandfather was not a bad person, and that there must be a good reason if he had to do something bad.","In hindsight, the mysterious old man was probably referring to the Netherworld Sect.","...","“Lord Netherworld Marshal, is Chu Feng truly Lord Netherworld Master’s son?” Chen Hui asked incredulously. He was even more shocked than Chu Feng.","“Yes, Lord Netherworld Master is the Chu Heavenly Clan’s Chu Hanxian, Chu Feng’s grandfather. Chu Feng is Lord Netherworld Master’s grandson, making him our Netherworld Sect’s young master.","“Our Netherworld Sect should have welcomed him as our leader, but I had no choice but to let Lord Netherworld Master down for your sake, Hui’er. I want you to become the next Netherworld Master.","“The tempering you have done is for this moment. This formation will strip Chu Feng of his Netherworld Embryo’s energy. As long as you obtain that, you’ll become our Netherworld Sect’s future. You can even surpass Lord Netherworld Master.","“Hui’er, this is not the time for unnecessary compassion. Devour Chu Feng’s energy right now! He might only be a soul, but you should be able to make the best out of it after your tempering earlier,” Dongfang Hansong said.","“I cannot do that, Lord Netherworld Marshal. If not for Lord Netherworld Master, there wouldn’t be today’s Netherworld Sect. Isn’t that what you taught me from a young age? How can we treat Lord Netherworld Master’s grandson like that?” Chen Hui turned down the offer.","He even got out of the blood pool.","Pah!","Dongfang Hansong gave Chen Hui a tight slap.","“You useless thing! Why do I have such a useless son? Do you know how much I have sacrificed for you? I braved hell together with Lord Netherworld Master! Do you think it doesn’t pain me to do this? Not to mention Lord Yun Ao as well—he has watched over not just you but me as well. I had to kill him to hide Chu Feng’s identity.","“Why do you think I did all that? It’s all for your sake!” Dongfang Hansong roared in anger.","But Chen Hui wasn’t moved in the least. If anything, he was infuriated.","“You... killed Lord Yun Ao?” Chen Hui glared at Dongfang Hansong.","Dongfang Hansong belatedly realized that he had misspoken, for Chen Hui shared a deep bond with Yun Ao. He should have never revealed that he had murdered Yun Ao.","“Hui’er, I’m doing this for you,” Dongfang Hansong explained.","Chen Hui’s breathing became ragged, and he couldn’t even conceal his wrath. He slowly lowered his head.","Dongfang Hansong tried to console him, but Chen Hui reached into his Cosmos Sack and pulled out a talisman paper. He activated the talisman paper, which imbued him with a powerful surge of energy that greatly raised his movement speed.","Then, Chen Hui dashed for the palace’s entrance.","Boom!","Before Chen Hui could escape, he abruptly collapsed to the floor in pain.","Dongfang Hansong had crushed him with his oppressive might. The sheer disparity in their cultivation made it impossible for Chen Hui to escape under Dongfang Hansong’s watch, no matter what tricks he pulled.","“Hui’er, don’t you understand? I did it all for you!” Dongfang Hansong slowly walked toward Chen Hui.","1. Chapter 4470: The chapter just shows an old man (a soul entity) calling Chu Feng ‘young master’. ☜"]},{"number":6702,"title":"Chapter 6702: Chapter 6700: Young Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 6700: Young Master","Chen Hui gritted his teeth. Tears flowed down his twisted face.","“How could you kill Lord Yun Ao? How could you let Lord Netherworld Master down? You even framed Lord Cang Li and the others of betraying the sect and stole their cultivation. You are the true traitor here! I’ll slaughter you! I’ll slaughter you!!!”","He tried to struggle to his feet but to no avail, so he could only roar in anger.","Dongfang Hansong stiffened up, and his eyes reddened.","“Don’t you get it, Hui’er? I am your real father. I am the reason you were cared for and nurtured by the Netherworld Sect and Lord Yun Ao. You only became the man you are today because of me! Everything I did, killing Yun Ao and making a move against Lord Netherworld Master’s son, isn't for me but you!” Dongfang Hansong said as he walked up to Chen Hui.","Shoosh!","There was a flash of cold light.","A God Armament saber sliced down on Dongfang Hansong.","Unguarded and weakened, Dongfang Hansong’s reaction was much slower than usual. He failed to dodge the attack, and the saber tore into his chest, leaving a bloody wound.","Xiahou Jue appeared out of thin air. He was wielding the very God Armament saber that had just cut Dongfang Hansong. He had also activated his Netherworld Embryo’s power, raising his cultivation to rank five Heavenly God level.","Chen Hui was shocked to see Xiahou Jue.","Xiahou Jue dispelled the oppressive might crushing Chen Hui and pulled him to his feet.","“Chen Hui, I didn’t expect you to have guts. Do you have to avenge Lord Yun Ao and save Lord Netherworld Master’s descendant?” Xiahou Jue asked.","“Yes, I do.” Chen Hui nodded.","Xiahou Jue pulled out a treasure and handed it to Chen Hui. “Lord Baili Xukong is currently awakening the sacred item. Look for him and tell him the truth.”","Chen Hui took Xiahou Jue’s treasure, but he hesitated. Baili Xukong also wanted Chu Feng dead because of his son. He doubted that Baili Xukong would be willing to help Chu Feng even after learning the truth.","“Don’t worry, Lord Baili Xukong and I are loyal to Lord Netherworld Master. Besides, who else can you rely on right now other than Lord Baili Xukong?” Xiahou Jue said.","Boom!","Even stronger oppressive might crushed down on Xiahou Jue and Chen Hui. Dongfang Hansong had raised his cultivation to rank six Heavenly God level. But he soon narrowed his eyes in shock.","His cultivation should have been more than enough to completely dominate Xiahou Jue, but somehow, Xiahou Jue had withstood his oppressive might.","The palace shook.","Xiahou Jue’s muscular body began to disintegrate as blood-red aura gushed out. It didn’t take long before his entire body was gone, and he was now a blood-red aura entity. He had become taller and more imposing than before.","He looked like a grown Netherworld Embryo, with sinister red eyes, but he was now stronger than ever. His cultivation had risen to rank six Heavenly God level.","“The Netherworld Sect’s secret skill? Xiahou Jue, are you tired of living?” Dongfang Hansong questioned.","“It’s a good thing I learned this secret skill, or else I’d have lost my life here. I was planning to use it against Xianhai Yu’er; I didn’t expect to use it against you. However, this is much more worthwhile. At least I’m fighting for Lord Netherworld Master right now!”","Xiahou Jue hurled out a punch, his martial power morphing into a beam of blood-red light.","Dongfang Hansong quickly employed a defensive martial skill, but the blood-red light still knocked him back and pinned him against the palace wall.","“Hold on, Lord Xiahou Jue!” Chen Hui shouted.","Seeing Xiahou Jue activate a secret skill that would result in his death to protect Chu Feng, Chen Hui’s hesitation disappeared. He activated the treasure he had received from Xiahou Jue and dashed out of the palace.","“You’re courting death!”","Dongfang Hansong pulled out a God Armament spear and unleashed a barrage of attacks.","In response, Xiahou Jue fought back with his God Armament saber.","A brief series of clashes followed. Dongfang Hansong failed to inflict any damage on Xiahou Jue, let alone kill the latter. Instead, a roundhouse kick from Xiahou Jue slammed him into the palace wall.","Blood wouldn’t stop spurting from Dongfang Hansong’s mouth as he slid down the wall. He had sustained considerable damage.","“Hahahaha! That’s all you amount to, Dongfang Hansong!” Xiahou Jue laughed heartily.","Dongfang Hansong should have been stronger than Xiahou Jue, especially since the latter had barely raised his cultivation to rank six Heavenly God level using a secret skill. However, he had sustained severe injuries from Chu Feng earlier, resulting in his weakening.","After mocking Dongfang Hansong, Xiahou Jue turned to Chu Feng and his smile vanished. Awkwardness loomed between them, especially for Xiahou Jue. He could have never imagined that the person he had been trying to kill was actually their young master.","But he made no attempt to explain himself. Instead, he put his emotions under control before asking with a grin, “How did I do, young master?”","“Not bad,” Chu Feng replied.","He was feeling conflicted as well. He had already placed Xiahou Jue into his kill list, but upon learning that his grandfather was the Netherworld Master whom the Netherworld Sect was loyal to, his perception of the Netherworld Sect changed.","Xiahou Jue harbored a deep grudge against Chu Feng, but upon learning about his true identity, he didn’t hesitate to put his life on the line to protect Chu Feng.","While Chu Feng had no mercy for his opponents, he also reciprocated the goodwill that others showed him.","“Guard your Netherworld Embryo. Don’t let its energy seep out. You still have a chance to survive this,” Chu Feng advised.","Xiahou Jue stiffened up. Tears glistened in his blood-red eyes.","Chu Feng’s concern struck deep into his heart. He remembered the care and concern that the Netherworld Master had shown him back then.","“Young master, my life belongs to Lord Netherworld Master. I wasn’t able to repay him, so I’ll offer my life to you instead.” Xiahou Jue brandished his God Armament saber and charged at Dongfang Hansong once more."]},{"number":6703,"title":"Chapter 6703: Chapter 6701: What Do You Mean?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6701: What Do You Mean?","Boom boom boom!","Destructive shockwaves shook the palace.","The palace shouldn’t have been able to withstand such damage even if it was a treasure, but it was currently bound to the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s formation. The sealing formation constructed by Jie Tianran’s clone was very powerful, making the palace nigh indestructible.","Despite two rank six Heavenly Gods fighting each other to the death inside the palace, those outside didn’t notice anything amiss at all.","Xiahou Jue fought with extreme aggression.","Donfang Hansong, due to his injuries, was forced to remain on the defensive. It looked like he wouldn’t last long at this rate.","However, the first one to succumb was not Dongfang Hansong but the formation he had constructed. Following the destruction of that formation, Chu Feng’s consciousness was transported back to his main body, inside the sealing formation.","He saw the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s warships gathered around him, and its world spiritists were channeling the formation. At the same time, they were looking at him with greedy eyes.","They were waiting for Chu Feng’s barrier to unravel, so that they could kill him.","What Chu Feng had just gone through and witnessed felt like a dream, but he knew that it did happen for real. His heart was still pounding hard. The revelation that his grandfather was the Netherworld Master came as a huge shock. He needed time to process what was going on.","“What’s wrong? Why aren’t you speaking?” Eggy asked anxiously.","Chu Feng understood that Eggy didn’t share his senses when his consciousness was torn away from his body earlier, so he quickly told her what had just happened.","“What? Your grandfather is the Netherworld Master? That makes you the Netherworld Sect’s young master! This is ridiculous, though it is exciting at the same time.” Eggy was very excited to hear the news as if she had just gotten the firsthand scoop.","“Doesn’t that make Baili Xukong and the others the traitors of the sect? I’m surprised that Xiahou Jue put his life on the line for you, but I feel like Baili Xukong is worse than Dongfang Hansong. I doubt he’ll help you even after learning that your grandfather is the Netherworld Master.","“Haa, why are those old things from the neutral faction so useless? They were done in by Dongfang Hansong at this critical moment and were even labeled as traitors. Despite being the Netherworld Sect’s young master, there’s no one left to help you anymore.” Eggy sighed.","She figured that since Dongfang Hansong could turn against Chu Feng for Chen Hui’s sake, there was no reason for Baili Xukong to be unable to do the same for Baili Zilin’s sake. The only allies Chu Feng had in the Netherworld Sect were the six neutral elders, but they were dead.","So, it was unlikely that Chu Feng’s identity as the Netherworld Sect’s young master would make a difference to the situation.","Chu Feng thought the same as well. While he was surprised that his grandfather was the Netherworld Master, he knew that he would have to overcome this hurdle by himself.","The first problem was his inability to breach the sealing formation.","Jie Tianran’s clone had fused itself into the sealing formation, using its energy to power it. Granted that it was swiftly losing energy, Chu Feng’s cultivation was also quickly depleting as the blue aura around him dissipated.","His cultivation was currently at rank five Heavenly God level. By the time Jie Tianran’s clone fully disintegrated, his cultivation would have further receded to rank four Heavenly God level. He wouldn’t even be able to deal with the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s Saint-tier elders by then, let alone Baili Xukong.","So, he came up with a plan.","He would make it seem like the Heaven Protection Shield Spirit was weakening.","The Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s world spiritists, guarded against his escape attempt, would channel their everything into the formation. That would hasten the depletion of not just their spirit power but that of Jie Tianran’s clone as well.","If Jie Tianran’s spirit power vanished while Chu Feng’s blue aura was still at rank five Heavenly God, he could at least break free from the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s encirclement.","He shared the plan with Eggy before weakening the Heaven Protection Shield Spirit’s energy.","“Look! Chu Feng’s protective means are weakening. His treasure must be reaching his limit!”","The Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s world spiritists had been paying close attention to Chu Feng, so they immediately noticed the anomaly.","“What’s there to celebrate? Do you have the power to stop me if I want to leave?” Chu Feng sneered as he pulled out a talisman paper.","“He’s planning to escape using a teleportation talisman paper! Reinforce the formation that prevents teleportation. Channel your everything into the sealing formation right now! Anyone who is found slacking off will be executed on the spot!” the Saint-tier elders and the Shadow Corps’ leaders hurriedly ordered.","Even Jie Tianran was traumatized from all the setbacks he had suffered in Chu Feng’s hands; they wouldn’t dare to let their guard down with Chu Feng as their opponent. They had to keep Chu Feng here no matter the cost.","Little did they know that Chu Feng was exploiting that mentality of theirs.","...","Martial power continued to ripple inside the palace, but the battle had concluded.","Xiahou Jue lay weakly at the entrance.","The blood-red aura shrouding him had become extremely weak. His current body was even smaller than his previous body, and he resembled an old man. There were sparks of blood-red aura on his tattered soul, but there was little doubt that he would die the moment those sparks faded.","However, he had no fear in the face of death. Instead, he looked at the approaching Dongfang Hansong with a gleeful smile.","“It’s too late, Dongfang Hansong. I gave Chen Hui my treasure. You can’t catch up to him now. Once Lord Baili is here...”","Halfway through Xiahou Jue’s words, he suddenly stiffened up.","Dongfang Hansong had taken out a fiery-red treasure. He channeled the treasure, and it converted into a fiery-red aura that seeped into his palm. He then placed his palm on Xiahou Jue’s dantian, causing the fiery-red aura to seep into the latter’s body.","Xiahou Jue felt no pain whatsoever. Instead, the blood-red aura shrouding him blazed with greater fervor.","“What do you mean by this?” Xiahou Ju was confused.","Dongfang Hansong was extending his life instead of killing him... but Xiahou Jue knew that he was as good as a dead man now. What was the point of this gesture?","Does he want to take me as a hostage to threaten Baili Xukong? That is ridiculous."]},{"number":6704,"title":"Chapter 6704: Chapter 6702: Admitting His Wrongdoings","paragraphs":["Chapter 6702: Admitting His Wrongdoings","“I was wrong,” Dongfang Hansong said in a deep, hoarse voice. He sounded regretful.","Xiahou Jue scoffed in contempt. “It’s too late. You can’t escape execution now.”","He glared at Dongfang Hansong with cold eyes. If not for his weakened state, he would have killed Dongfang Hansong there and then. He didn’t waver in the least just because Dongfang Hansong apologized.","Dongfang Hansong didn’t bother explaining. He grabbed Xiahou Jue and left the palace. He headed away from where Chu Feng was held captive and instead made his way to one of the Netherworld Sect’s forbidden lands.","It was a palace constructed out of treasures. Dongfang Hansong’s aides guarded the place.","“How are you feeling, milord? Did the new faction do this?”","Dongfang Hansong’s aides looked at the weakened Dongfang Hansong, followed by the soul entity Xiahou Jue, and they instinctively thought that Baili Xukong had assaulted him.","“I’m fine.” Dongfang Hansong waved his hand as he kicked the door open.","In the palace lay the six neutral elders. They had lost their cultivation and were in an extremely weakened state, but they remained conscious.","Fury blazed in their eyes when they saw Dongfang Hansong. They wanted to curse at him, but they widened their eyes in astonishment when they saw him grabbing Xiahou Jue. It led them to think that a conflict had broken out between the conservative faction and the new faction.","Dongfang Hansong’s aides, oblivious to the truth, entered the palace.","The last one to enter even tactfully closed the door, sensing that whatever that was going to happen next had to be kept confidential.","Dongfang Hansong walked up to the six neutral elders and kneeled before them. He took out the treasure fused with the Netherworld Master’s aura.","“That is...”","The eyes of everyone present lit up. It was a familiar aura.","“Milords, Hansong has deceived you. Lord Netherworld Master is Chu Feng’s grandfather, which means that Chu Feng... is our Netherworld Sect’s young master.”","That revelation shocked the six neutral elders. Even when Dongfang Hansong stole their cultivation, they had never doubted him of lying to them on this matter.","Dongfang Hansong’s aides also felt as if they had been struck by lightning. They stood completely dumbstruck on the spot.","“I was selfish. I wanted my son, Chen Hui, to become the Netherworld Master. To conceal the truth, I killed Lord Yun Ao, who accompanied me on my journey,” Dongfang Hansong said.","His aides widened their eyes in disbelief. They hadn’t known about these matters, but they completely shattered their faith and loyalty toward Dongfang Hansong.","“I foolishly put myself above the sect. I thought I had to pave Chen Hui’s path at any cost, even if it meant betraying Lord Netherworld Master.” Dongfang Hansong shook his head bitterly. “To think that I followed Lord Netherworld Master to war, but my loyalty to the Netherworld Sect still pales in comparison to Hui’er.”","Dongfang Hansong sensed murderous auras flaring from behind. His aides had drawn their weapons and directed their killing intent toward him.","“Lord Dongfang Hansong, are you speaking the truth?” a middle-aged woman coldly asked.","Her cultivation was on par with Dongfang Hansong. She was one of Dongfang Hansong’s most trusted aides. Yet, she looked at him with a murderous gaze.","Dongfang Hansong ignored his aides and continued facing the six neutral elders.","“Milords, the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion has constructed a sealing formation that is siphoning away the energy of our young master’s Netherworld Embryo. I wanted Chen Hui to devour that energy, but he refused upon learning the truth and even set off to report the matter to Baili Xukong under Xiahou Jue’s protection.","“Parents are bound to prioritize their children. Even I have turned my back on the sect for Chen Hui’s sake; I fear that Baili Xukong will pick his son over loyalty,” Dongfang Hansong said.","“Pui! You’re the despicable one here. Don’t drag Lord Baili down with you!” Xiahou Jue scoffed.","“Sometimes, people struggle to even know themselves. Xiahou Jue, how can you be sure that you truly understand Baili Xukong?” Dongfang Hansong asked.","“Dongfang Hansong, what are you getting at?” Cang Li asked.","“Lord Cang Li, I know that I have done wrong. I just want to make up for my mistake now. However, I am no match for Baili Xukong in my wounded state. That’s why I implore you to make a move to ensure our young master’s safety,” Dongfang Hansong said.","The weakened Lie Shan, by some unknown bout of strength, leaped to his feet.","“Screw you, Dongfang Hansong! You and Baili Xukong stole our cultivation, and you still want us to help you right now?!” Lie Shan was truly infuriated. He wanted to slap Baili Xukong, but he was so weak that he crumbled to the floor barely after taking two steps.","Just then, Dongfang Hansong took out a blood-red pill.","The six neutral elders, Dongfang Hansong’s aides, and Xiahou Jue were taken aback.","The blood-red pill resembled a Netherworld Embryo. All Netherworld Sectmembers knew what the pill was.","Dongfang Hansong swallowed the pill. A blood-red aura flared from his body. It was nowhere as intense as when Xiahou Jue activated the secret skill, but they were similar in nature.","He stood up, turned to his aides, and clasped his fist at them. “Thank you for following me for so many years. I apologize for letting you down. However, this matter concerns our young master’s safety. I implore you to help me one last time, so that I can return the six lords’ cultivation.”","He turned around, faced the six neutral elders, and sat down.","He formed a hand seal, and blood immediately flowed from his eyes, nostrils, ears, and mouth, and his body began disintegrating. His hair turned gray, and his skin corroded into blood. It was as if he was undergoing an excruciating torture.","Just looking at his current state was enough to make anyone squirm.","But Dongfang Hansong gritted his teeth and held on. He was channeling six surges of blood-red martial power toward the six neutral elders.","Xiahou Jue couldn’t believe his eyes. The six neutral elders were in disbelief as well.","Dongfang Hansong was sacrificing his life to return the cultivation of the six neutral elders!","“Get into formation!”","Dongfang Hansong’s aides quickly channeled the power of their Netherworld Embryos to aid Dongfang Hansong.","Half of the six neutral elders’ cultivation was currently with Dongfang Hansong. This power was only enough to raise Dongfang Hansong’s fighting prowess, but the situation would be different if it was returned to the six neutral elders.","The combined prowess of the six neutral elders, even in weakened states, was more than enough to curb Baili Xukong."]},{"number":6705,"title":"Chapter 6705: Chapter 6703: Loyalty","paragraphs":["Chapter 6703: Loyalty","Meanwhile, Baili Xukong, along with his new faction and Dongfang Hansong’s conservative faction, were kneeling before a towering black gate that was over a hundred thousand meters in height.","This was the Netherworld Sect’s sacred item.","The Netherworld Sectmembers channeled the power of their Netherworld Embryos through the black bracelets toward the sacred item. Under the tug of their power, the black gate had already opened by half.","All of them clenched their jaws in hardship, including Baili Xukong. They knew that their efforts would be in vain if they failed to open the sacred item, but the feat was proving harder than they had expected.","“Hold on! Victory is already in sight!” Baili Xukong shouted, but it did little to raise morale.","He had already said those words many times. Yet, the black gate was slowly closing despite their desperate attempt to open it. They could still perk themselves up and force themselves to persist, but they were so exhausted now that it was beyond them.","“Why is the sacred item so hard to awaken?”","Even Baili Xukong was feeling despondent.","They had been able to open the sacred item by a larger degree back when the black bracelets were still incomplete, which was why he was certain that they would succeed now that the black bracelets were in their complete forms.","Yet, they felt even more pushback from the sacred item this time around. They weren’t even able to open it to the same degree as before.","“Fools,” a voice that sounded like it had come from hell echoed from the sacred item.","The crowd felt their Netherworld Embryos jolting in response to the voice. None of them had heard this voice before, but somehow, it felt like it was summoning them.","Boom!","The black gate suddenly closed.","The Netherworld Sectmembers collapsed to the ground from exhaustion. They had failed to awaken their sacred item. However, there was something that loomed heavier than their failure.","“Milord, I heard a voice from within the sacred item scolding us,” Jimo Qianzhou said.","“I heard it as well,” Wuma Hanshuang added.","“Father, I heard as well,” Baili Zilin said.","All of the Netherworld Sectmembers present expressed that they had heard the voice. This greatly delighted Baili Xukong, who thought that he had been hearing things. The sacred item might have been scolding them, but this was a good sign.","“There is no need to be disheartened. This is the first time the sacred item has answered us, which means that we are only a step away from awakening it,” Baili Xukong said.","Just then, a jarring explosion that resembled a furious roar could be heard from within the sacred item. It caused the surrounding space to quake intensely.","This quake didn’t hurt any of the Netherworld Sectmembers, but it robbed them of their balance. Even Baili Xukong fell to his knees.","The blood-red aura shrouding the sacred item began gathering above the black gate to form massive words. The eyes of Baili Xukong and the others lit up. They could already decipher the message before all the words were formed.","It was a clue from the sacred item.","The sacred item has appeared due to the Netherworld Embryo Spirituality Summoning Altar...","Baili Xukong trembled in glee. He immediately turned to his son, Baili Zilin.","If the sacred item had appeared due to the Netherworld Embryo Spirituality Summoning Altar, the key to awakening the sacred item must be the person who had been recognized by the altar. And that person was none other than his son!","The others also came to the same conclusion, including Baili Zilin.","Faced with expectant looks from the crowd, Baili Zilin felt incredibly conscience-stricken.","He knew that the one who received the Netherworld Embryo Spirituality Summoning Altar’s recognition was not him but Chu Feng.","The sacred item continued to reveal more words.","Only the one who awakened the altar can awaken the sacred item, and that person is the descendant of the last Netherworld Master .","Baili Xukong was dumbstruck.","This doesn’t make sense. Baili Zilin is my son. He wasn’t even born when Lord Netherworld Master first left, so there’s no way I could have been cuckolded by Lord Netherworld Master. Why does the sacred item’s clue say that the one who awakened the altar is Lord Netherworld master’s descendant?","There’s no way the sacred item is wrong, right?","Baili Zilin trembled in fear. His face turned pale, and sweat flowed down his back. His eyes turned bloodshot from sheer nervousness. He immediately knew what was going on, and he also understood that there was no way for him to continue his lie.","“Father!” Baili Zilin kneeled before Baili Xukong.","“What are you doing, Zilin?” Baili Xukong panicked.","He was still wondering if Baili Zilin was the Netherworld Master’s son due to some convoluted circumstances.","“I was wrong, father. I wasn’t the one who awakened the Netherworld Embryo Spirituality Summoning Altar that day.” Baili Zilin’s eyes were reddened with regret.","“Who could it be if not you?” Baili Xukong asked.","Everyone stared intently at Baili Zilin.","“It was Chu Feng,” Baili Zilin replied.","“What?!”","That revelation shocked everyone.","“LORD BAILI XUKONG!”","Just then, Chen Hui’s voice echoed from afar. His face was visibly paler, and he was already shouting anxiously even though he was still a distance away.","“Lord Baili Xukong, Dongfang Hansong lied to everyone. Lord Cang Li was right. Chu Feng’s grandfather is Lord Netherworld Master. Chu Feng is Lord Netherworld Master’s descendant! Lord Xiahou Jue is desperately stalling Dongfang Hansong to buy time for me to relay this news to you. He won’t last long at this rate!”","Baili Xukong, Wuma Hanshuang, Jimo Qianzhou, and the others anxiously rose into the air to face Chen Hui.","Baili Xukong took out Xiahou Jue’s life token—it hadn’t shattered, but it was covered in cracks. This showed that Xiahou Jue was dying.","“Chen Hui, are you speaking the truth?” Baili Xukong asked grimly.","“I wouldn’t dare to lie about this!” Chen Hui said. He noticed the words above the sacred item and immediately pointed at it, saying, “Look there! Isn’t the sacred item saying the same thing as well?”","Baili Zilin kneeled before Baili Xukong once more. “Father, I witnessed Chu Feng awaken the altar in person. There is no doubt. He is Lord Netherworld Master’s descendant. I was a fool. Why didn’t I think about it earlier? Chu Feng’s Netherworld Embryo is so powerful, and he was even able to control the sacred item. The sacred item appeared after he awakened the altar. That couldn’t have been a coincidence. Chu Feng is Lord Netherworld Master’s descendant!”","Tears and snot of regret flowed down his face.","“Milord, the matter must be true. Everything fits together if Chu Feng is Lord Netherworld Master’s descendant, our young master,” Jimo Qianzhou said.","Baili Xukong looked conflicted. Even his breathing became hastened. It was rare for him to be so discomposed.","Baili Ziling grabbed Baili Xukong’s leg and urged, “Father, if not for Lord Netherworld Master, there wouldn’t have been our Netherworld Sect today. You can’t let Lord Netherworld Master down just because of me!”","Those words infuriated Baili Xukong, and veins popped from his temples. He kicked Baili Zilin away and drew his God Armament saber. “What do you mean? Are you doubting my loyalty to Lord Netherworld Master? If not for your accursed lie, I would have never been misled. I nearly caused the death of Lord Netherworld Master’s descendant because of you! I’ll first execute you before ending my own life to atone for the crimes I have done to the young master!”","Baili Xukong raised his God Armament saber.","Wuma Hanshuang, Jimo Qianzhou, and the others quickly hugged Baili Xukong to stop him. They knew about his loyalty and admiration for the Netherworld Master. He wouldn’t hesitate to kill his own son for the Netherworld Master.","“Calm down, milord! Killing young master Zilin won’t change the situation!”","“Milord, we should let the young master decide how to punish young master Zilin!”","“Indeed! The important thing right now is to ensure the young master’s safety!”","The crowd anxiously dissuaded Baili Xukong from making a reckless move.","Even Dongfang Hansong’s subordinates joined in as well. They had been guarded against Baili Xukong, especially since they were from the conservative faction, but things were different now. Their stances had changed upon learning that Chu Feng was their young master.","To hell with the new faction and the conservative faction! Their masters were no longer Dongfang Hansong or Baili Xukong. They only had one master now—Chu Feng.","“Right, the young master!” Baili Xukong regained his composure.","But fury blazed in his eyes once more, and his killing intent was stronger than ever. He thought about everything the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion had done to Chu Feng.","“Screw them!” he spat. He raised his God Armament saber and roared, “Heed my orders, Netherworld Sectmembers! The Seven Realms Sacred Mansion brazenly oppressed our young master. From this moment onward, they are our enemies. Kill their people on sight. Show no mercy!”","Cold gleams flashed across space.","The Netherworld Sectmembers drew their weapons and answered resoundingly, “Kill the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion!”","—","Author’s Note:","We’re about to conclude God’s Era. I’ll try my best to make the final battle more exciting.","The next arc will be Martial God Asura’s final arc. There won’t be any new maps. All the mysteries will be unraveled."]},{"number":6706,"title":"Chapter 6706: Chapter 6704: Unable to Die in Peace","paragraphs":["Chapter 6704: Unable to Die in Peace","Chu Feng’s plan went smoothly.","His precise control of the Heaven Protection Shield Spirit went a long way. He kept it in an ambiguous state, where it seemed to be on the verge of destruction but not really.","The Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s world spiritists dared not lower their guard. They put their all into channeling the sealing formation and the formation that hindered teleportation.","Chu Feng’s blue aura was still at rank five Heavenly God level, whereas Jie Tianran’s clone was already on the verge of depletion. The Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s world spiritists wouldn’t be able to stop him once the sealing formation was gone.","“Chu Feng, I know what you’re scheming,” an old man standing on a distant warship with glowing green eyes said. He was one of the Saint-tier elders, Ling Mouzi.","Behind him stood other Saint-tier elders. They, too, looked at Chu Feng with the same gaze.","“Oh? Tell me about it.”","“Once your barrier unravels, you only have your blue aura to fall back on. You know you won’t be a match for us, so your only option is to enhance your speed with a formation and attempt to escape. However, you are underestimating our sealing formation.","“This sealing formation contains Lord Mansion Master’s spirit power. You won’t be able to break out of it even if your cultivation was still at rank six Heavenly God level. If you surrender now, we won’t kill you. But if you insist on fighting to the end, you’re only courting your death,” Ling Mouzi said.","“Do I look like I was born yesterday?” Chu Feng scoffed in disdain.","Ling Mouzi thought that Chu Feng hadn’t noticed the imminent dissipation of Jie Tianran’s clone, since the clone was impeccably fused into the sealing formation. He thought that he could intimidate Chu Feng with that.","“Hah! Chu Feng, I am doing this for your own good. You’ll know what true despair is once you come face to face with the sealing formation!” Ling Mouzi sneered.","“Ling Mouzi, let me tell you something in return then,” Chu Feng said.","“What is it?” Ling Mouzi asked.","“The moment my barrier unravels is the moment of your deaths,” Chu Feng declared.","Ling Mouzi and the others looked unfazed, but they secretly clenched their sleeves out of panic.","“Does that brat possess some kind of means to kill us?”","They had intended to intimidate Chu Feng, only to end up intimidating themselves. But they couldn’t be blamed for their cowardice, for Chu Feng possessed means that they couldn’t see through.","Just then, Chu Feng narrowed his eyes. He noticed countless cold gleams that resembled a cloud of light in distant space. They were all weapons! Countless weapons, along with a huge army, gathered around the vicinity like locusts.","They were Netherworld Sectmembers.","“I thought they left to awaken their sacred item. Why did they return so quickly? Did the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion request their reinforcement?”","Chu Feng felt an ominous feeling when he saw the Netherworld Sect’s army. He knew that he didn’t have the strength to deal with Baili Xukong now. This could spell the failure of his plan.","“Hahahaha! Chu Feng, what did you just say? Did you say that we’re going to die? Your blue aura has already receded to rank five Heavenly God level. How do you intend to deal with the Netherworld Sect’s Lord Baili?”","Ling Mouzi and the others grinned as if they had finally found their backbone. They were only putting on a brave front earlier to intimidate Chu Feng, but now, they had the Netherworld Sect backing them.","There was nothing for them to be afraid about anymore.","As the Netherworld Sect drew closer, the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s world spiritists noticed their overwhelming killing intent, and that widened their gleeful smiles.","“Looks like the Netherworld Sect’s hatred for Chu Feng surpasses even ours.”","“Chu Feng did massacre many of their sectmembers. I bet they are dying to tear out his tendons and skin him alive.”","Meanwhile, Baili Xukong, together with Wuma Hanshuang, Jimo Qinazhou, Baili Zilin, and the others landed on the warship where Ling Mouzi and the other Saint-tier elders were stationed.","“Lord Baili, you arrived on time. That Chu Feng was still mocking me earlier, saying that he will kill us!” Ling Mouzi and the Saint-tier elders walked up to Baili Xukong with triumphant smiles.","Despite being Saint-tier elders, they still treated Baili Xukong with respect. The latter was capable of raising his cultivation to rank six Heavenly God level, after all.","They didn’t notice Baili Xukong and his subordinates’ gazes turning even colder when Ling Mouzi mentioned Chu Feng.","“He doesn’t have to. We’ll do it for him,” Baili Xukong said.","“Ah?” Ling Mouzi and the other Saint-tier elders were stunned.","GAHHH!","Screams of agony echoed from all around.","The Saint-tier elders were flabbergasted.","The Netherworld Sect’s army had begun slaughtering the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s members, dicing them into pieces as if to vent their anger.","“Baili Xukong, are you out of your mind?!”","Ling Mouzi and the other Saint-tier elders’ smiles vanished, and their faces warped in anger. They angrily surrounded Baili Xukong as if demanding a satisfactory explanation from him.","Pu!","But instead of receiving Baili Xukong’s explanation, they found themselves faced with his God Armament saber instead.","Ling Mouzi lowered his head and saw a saber piercing through his dantian. His spirit power was swiftly leaking away.","This plunged all the Saint-tier elders into fear.","Baili Xukong had raised his cultivation to rank six Heavenly God level. When he exerted his oppressive might, even rank five Heavenly Dragon World Spiritists were powerless before him like lambs in a slaughterhouse.","“I’ll let you die a knowing death. Chu Feng is our Netherworld Sect’s young master,” Baili Xukong revealed.","The pupils of Ling Mouzi and the others widened like chicken eggs. They doubted their ears. But before they could ask anything, Baili Xukong swung his blade.","Shoosh!","Blood splattered everywhere.","Ling Mouzi and the other Saint-tier elders were cleaved into two. They were dead, but even so, their confused expressions persisted. They weren’t able to die in peace."]},{"number":6707,"title":"Chapter 6707: Chapter 6705: Punished On the Spot","paragraphs":["Chapter 6705: Punished On the Spot","But Baili Xukong couldn’t care less about that. He grabbed Ling Mouzi’s upper body and raised it like a symbol of victory.","“Netherworld Sectmembers! Claim the heads of the dogshit Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s members and collect your rewards from me after the battle!”","“Lord Netherworld Marshal, there is no need for rewards when we’re fighting for the young master!”","Those who had been holding the heads of the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s members as spoils of war tossed them aside.","“Good!” Baili Xukong was satisfied with their responses.","He raised his God Armament saber and slaughtered his way through into the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s army like an unstoppable god of slaughter. Wherever he passed, ships were destroyed, humans were dissected, and blood splattered.","But this sight was not limited to where Baili Xukong was.","The Netherworld Sect had the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s army surrounded. The carnage was happening everywhere.","Chu Feng saw the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s members around him being reduced to blood fog.","Screams of pain filled the air. The Netherworld Sectmembers weren’t just killing the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s members; they were like ravenous wolves tearing into their enemies as if venting their anger.","“Does your grandfather command such strong rallying power? Baili Xukong didn’t hesitate to choose his stance after learning about your identity. Oh? That means that Dongfang Hansong is the only asshole in the Netherworld Sect. Their cruelty satisfies me a lot.”","Eggy’s eyes glowed in excitement.","Chu Feng felt conflicted. The Netherworld Sect had tried everything they could to kill him. He had even slaughtered his way into their ranks just moments ago, so the grudge between them should have been irreconcilable.","Yet, they didn’t hesitate to turn against the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion for him when they learned that he was their Netherworld Master’s grandson. They displayed extreme animosity toward the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion when there was no grudge between them.","Their reactions were so extreme that it shook Chu Feng up a little. In the end, he could only remark with a sigh, “The Netherworld Sect sure is interesting.”","...","Meanwhile, the palace, where Dongfang Hansong and the others were, was isolated from the world, so they were oblivious to what was happening outside.","A blood-red formation had been constructed inside the palace, but it was reaching its limit.","Dongfang Hansong’s subordinates were gasping for air on the ground, having expended themselves greatly from channeling the formation.","The six neutral elders had shedded their weakness and regained their previous dispositions. They were no longer powerless old men. They had regained their rank five Heavenly God level cultivation, though their fighting prowess was weaker than before.","In contrast, Dongfang Hansong was in a terrible state. He had been reduced to a soul entity, and his condition was even worse than Xiahou Jue’s. He kneeled feebly on the floor, looking like he would disintegrate at any moment.","“Dongfang Hansong, don’t think that we’ll forgive you just because you returned our cultivation to us. Your crimes will never be forgiven. You will be forever shamed in our Netherworld Sect!” Lie Shan glared at Dongfang Hansong wrathfully.","Even Cang Li couldn’t bring himself to forgive Dongfang Hansong. He could overlook the latter’s folly but not his betrayal of the Netherworld Master.","The six neutral elders quickly headed out of the palace.","Dongfang Hansong’s aides, despite being so weakened that they could hardly stand, struggled to their feet. They wanted to join the six neutral elders in rescuing Chu Feng.","Dongfang Hansong feebly spoke up, “Milords, I, Dongfang Hansong, am a traitor of the sect. I don’t expect any forgiveness. However, Chen Hui is loyal to the sect. I hope you won’t implicate him in my crime in view of his steadfast loyalty.”","The six neutral elders paused when they heard those words.","“Don’t worry. Your crimes are too grievous to be forgiven, but Chen Hui’s merits are inerasable as well. The Netherworld Sect will treat him well,” Cang Li said before crushing the palace gate under his feet.","They were about to soar into the sky when they suddenly froze up. There was a vast blood fog in the sky, and warship debris was scattered everywhere.","Netherworld Sectmembers were brutally massacring the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s members!","“Hah...”","The crowd burst into laughter. They immediately understood Baili Xukong’s decision.","“I knew it. That lad, Baili Xukong, worships Lord Netherworld Master so much. How can he possibly betray Lord Netherworld Master for his son?” Lie Shan laughed heartily.","“That’s not what you said earlier. You said that Baili Xukong is too ambitious, and that he will stoop to anything for his son,” Ting Yun pointed out.","“You must have misheard. I didn’t say that.” Lie Shan awkwardly coughed.","“Enough. Now is not the time for us to bicker. Now that we have confirmed Chu Feng as our young master, how can we not participate in a fight against the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion? Let’s show those people the plight that befalls those who cross our young master!”","With that, the six neutral elders and Dongfang Hansong’s aides charged toward the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s world spiritists. They took Xiahou Jue’s tattered soul along with them.","Dongfang Hansong was the only one left in the palace. He was so feeble that it was strenuous for him to even flip his body over. He could only slowly move his body on the floor.","But even when he flipped over, he realized that he couldn’t see what was happening in the distance. The palace doors were open, so he could hear fighting sounds and the screams of agony from the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s members.","He chuckled under his breath. His laughter carried a tinge of relief and bitterness.","“I was the only one who betrayed Lord Netherworld Master. Lord Netherworld Master, if there is an afterlife, may I be reborn as your cow or horse to repay your grace,” Dongfang Hansong said with the final sliver of his energy.","His soul finally dissipated into thin air.","The participation of the six neutral elders on the battlefield only hastened the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s downfall. It didn’t take long for silence to return to the surroundings.","All of the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s members, including the Saint-tier elders and the Shadow Corps’ elites and leaders, had been massacred. The sealing formation unraveled along with their deaths.","The Netherworld Sectmembers stood in a neat formation in front of Chu Feng as if an army awaiting inspection.","Baili Xukong and the six neutral elders stood at the forefront.","The six neutral elders couldn’t conceal their excitement; Lie Shan was even tearing up and leaking snot. Baili Xukong, on the other hand, had a conflicted expression.","Despite his fearless personality, he was visibly nervous right now. In the end, he mustered his courage to walk up to Chu Feng and drop to his knees.","“I was blind to not recognize the young master. I foolishly joined forces with the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion and made attempts on your life. I deserve to die a thousand times over. Please punish me, young master.”","Baili Xukong offered his God Armament saber with both hands."]},{"number":6708,"title":"Chapter 6708: Chapter 6706: Sending Off Xiahou Jue","paragraphs":["Chapter 6706: Sending Off Xiahou Jue","“I deserve death as well.” Jimo Qianzhou also kneeled to Chu Feng and offered his weapon with both hands.","“Please sentence me to death.” Wuma Hanshuang also kneeled to Chu Feng.","Both Chu Feng and Eggy were stunned. They had seen countless people begging for their lives, but it was rare to see people begging to be killed.","Baili Zilin’s actions were even more exaggerated. He kneeled beside his father and kowtowed profusely to Chu Feng, saying, ‘Young master, I was wrong. I coveted your accomplishment of awakening the Netherworld Embryo Spirituality Summoning Altar. My father was merely fooled by me. Please spare my father!”","Baili Zilin cried sorrowfully. It was disgusting to see his tears mix with his snot. This was the most sincere side of him that Chu Feng had seen, and he was not begging for his own life but his father’s.","To be honest, Chu Feng was moved.","But Baili Xukong suddenly stood up and lifted his son by his hair as if grabbing a chick.","“If not for your jealousy, we wouldn’t have viewed the young master as our enemy, and everything wouldn’t have been such a mess. You are the culprit behind everything! I’ll execute you first!” Baili Xukong said as he lifted his God Armament saber.","Everything happened so quickly that only the six neutral elders had time to react. Two quickly hugged Baili Xukong in place, two snatched his God Armament saber over, and the remaining two attempted to pull Baili Zilin to safety.","But Baili Xukong was grabbing Baili Zilin by his hair—there was no way for the neutral elders to bring the latter to safety.","Baili Zilin was in so much pain that he clenched his teeth. Even more tears and snot flowed down his face.","“Baili Xukong, your son has committed many wrongdoings. We won’t speak up on his behalf. However, we should leave this matter for the young master to judge,” Ting Yun said.","Baili Xukong finally calmed down and looked at Chu Feng. He looked so obedient that Chu Feng had little doubt that Baili Xukong wouldn’t hesitate to murder anyone he told him to.","“Baili Xukong, will you listen to my commands?” Chu Feng finally spoke up.","“Young master, my life is yours,” Baili Xukong replied right away.","“Release your son.”","Baili Xukong released Baili Zilin.","Baili Zilin was scared out of his wits. He had known that his father revered the Netherworld Master, such that even his own loyalty toward the Netherworld Master was his father’s influence. However, he didn’t expect his father to attempt to kill him.","“I am surprised by everything that has happened today. I didn’t expect my grandfather to have such deep ties with the Netherworld Sect, and I didn’t think that you would remain so loyal to him even though he isn’t here. Despite our grudges, you didn’t hesitate to side with me after learning about my identity.” Chu Feng bowed deeply to the Netherworld Sectmembers.","“You mustn’t, young master!”","All the Netherworld Sectmembers hurriedly fell to their knees and kowtowed deeply.","That moved Chu Feng even more. He could understand why Baili Xukong and the six neutral elders were so loyal to his grandfather, but to think that even the juniors like Baili Zilin and Chen Hui, who had never met his grandfather, would display such loyalty as well.","This was the tradition propagated by the Netherworld Sect, beliefs that were passed down from one generation to another. These beliefs bonded them tightly, allowing them to become a mighty force within the world of cultivation.","Very few powers had such unity.","“You may get up now. Let’s not talk about the past anymore. From now on, the Netherworld Sect is one family with the Chu Clan Alliance. Is anyone opposed to that?” Chu Feng asked.","“We approve!” all the Netherworld Sectmembers raised their hands and exclaimed.","Some even raised both their hands out of enthusiasm, but it looked as if they were surrendering instead. It was a funny sight. Even the grim Chu Feng couldn’t help but smile.","Who could have expected the widely-feared Netherworld Sect to be such a loyal bunch? No one could have imagined that they would have such an adorable side to them.","Just then, Chu Feng thought of one person.","“Has Xiahou Jue already...” Chu Feng asked.","“Ah, I nearly forgot about that fellow.” Cang Li waved his sleeve, and Xiahou Jue appeared before Chu Feng.","“Xiahou Jue.”","Baili Xukong, Wuma Hanshuang, Jimo Qianzhou, and the others rushed forward and swarmed him. They had been comrades for many years, and they were as close as brothers. They were pained by his plight. Wuma Hanshuang even shed tears.","Xiahou Jue’s soul had become as thin as air. He was at his limit.","“Is there a way to save him?” Chu Feng asked Baili Xukong and the six neutral elders.","“Young master, he used our secret skill. There is no way to survive the backlash,” Baili Xukong replied.","“What about the sacred item?” Chu Feng asked.","“Right! The sacred item might work. We still don’t know what kind of power it harnesses, but it may be capable of saving Xiahou Jue!” Wuma Hanshuang exclaimed.","The eyes of Baili Xukong and the others lit up.","“Let’s give it a try,” Chu Feng commanded.","The Netherworld Sect immediately made their way toward the sacred item.","Just then, Xiahou Jue grabbed Chu Feng’s sleeve and said, “Young master, it’s too late.”","HIs feeble and hoarse voice made it clear that he wouldn’t survive till the sacred item’s awakening. He showed no fear despite being on the verge of death. Instead, he smiled tenderly at Chu Feng.","“Young master, there are some words I have been wanting to tell you but dare not to. Young master, you are truly an incredible person. I have never seen any junior as tenacious as you. I’m not talking about your talent but your fearless personality, as well as your damned charisma.","“You emerged from the Ancestral Martial Galaxy without any backing, but somehow, you won over so many followers and became the most famous prodigy in the world of cultivation. Looking at you reminds me of Lord Netherworld Master’s younger self. The two of you are too alike.","“I have always wondered why such a junior isn’t in our Netherworld Sect. If you could take the reins, I am certain that our Netherworld Sect will rise to greater heights just as it did under Lord Netherworld Master.","“My dream came true. You really are one of us. You are Lord Netherworld Master’s grandson. I... cough cough cough ...” Xiahou Jue got so excited that he began to cough violently.","His soul wavered intensely, looking as if it would extinguish at any moment.","Chu Feng placed his hand on Xiahou Jue’s dantian and infused into him his Netherworld Embryo’s energy. Baili Xukong and the neutral elders followed suit, but Xiahou Jue’s condition didn’t improve.","Xiahou Jue grabbed Chu Feng’s hand and smiled. “Young master, please don’t waste your strength. I know that I won’t survive this ordeal. But I’m glad. Death doesn’t frighten me; it is dying in vain that scares me. I was able to lay down my life to protect young master. There is nothing more worthwhile than that. If you ever meet Lord Netherworld Master, please tell him that I, Xiahou Jue, am not a coward.”","His smile continued to linger, but his life force had faded.","“Farewell, Xiahou Jue,” Chu Feng murmured.","“Farewell, Lord Xiahou Jue!” the Netherworld Sectmembers roared.","The Netherworld Sect watched with heavy hearts as Xiahou Jue’s soul drifted into the distance as a wisp of smoke."]},{"number":6709,"title":"Chapter 6709: Chapter 6707: Awakening the Sacred Item","paragraphs":["Chapter 6707: Awakening the Sacred Item","Xiahou Jue’s death left many in tears. Were it not for his sacrifice, they might have never learned about Chu Feng’s real identity and saved him.","Baili Zilin suddenly recalled something. He opened his palm and formed a hand seal. A figure fell out from his palm.","It was the Netherworld Envoy who had implanted a Netherworld Embryo inside Chu Feng, brought Song Yun into the Netherworld Sect, and duped him into activating the Netherworld Embryo Spirituality Summoning Altar.","Chu Feng was taken aback. He had thought that the Netherworld Envoy was dead.","The Netherworld Envoy was confused. He had no idea what had happened as he had been trapped inside Baili Zilin’s realm all this while. The last thing he remembered was Chu Feng leaving after awakening the Netherworld Embryo Spirituality Summoning Altar, and Baili Zilin attempting to take the credit for that.","He had spent his days in anguish afterward, trapped inside a blank realm devoid of day and night.","He didn’t expect to be released all of a sudden, not to mention that he was now standing in the presence of so many powerful figures that someone of his stature wouldn’t be qualified to come into contact with.","The moment he spotted Chu Feng, he became extremely agitated. He thought that Chu Feng was in danger.","“Run, Chu Feng!”","He anxiously turned to the six neutral elders and exclaimed, “Milords, I don’t know what Lord Zilin has told you, but please allow me to speak. This concerns the Netherworld Sect’s future...”","The Netherworld Sectmembers chuckled. Even Chu Feng smiled.","The Netherworld Envoy was confused.","“You want to tell us that Chu Feng awakened the Netherworld Embryo Spirituality Summoning Altar, right?” Ting Yun asked.","“Milord... y-you already know?” The Netherworld Envoy was taken aback.","“Not only do we know that Chu Feng was the one who awakened the altar, but we also know now that Chu Feng is Lord Netherworld Master’s grandson, our young master,” Ting Yun replied.","“Ah?” The Netherworld Envoy was astonished. Then, he shook his head in dismay and sighed. “I must be hallucinating after being trapped for too long.”","It was one thing for the Netherworld Sect to find out that Chu Feng had awakened the altar, but it seemed hopelessly optimistic for Chu Feng to be their young master on top of that. That didn’t sound plausible to him. He thought that it was dreaming.","“Elder, I’m glad that you’re fine,” Chu Feng walked up to the Netherworld Envoy and said.","His fate with the Netherworld Sect started because of this Netherworld Envoy. However, this was no time to reminisce about the past, since a greater threat was currently approaching them.","His previous plan was to pit his life against Jie Tianran, but now, there was an alternative option—the Netherworld Sect’s sacred item. At his command, the Netherworld Sectmembers made their way toward the sacred item.","Chu Feng had regained his Netherworld Embryo’s energy after Dongfang Hansong’s formation came undone, so he was not worried about running out of energy when awakening the sacred item.","Along the way, the Netherworld Sect continued to slaughter the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s members. They handed all the treasures and origin energies gathered to Chu Feng.","Chu Feng accepted them. By now, he had gathered a huge amount of origin energies, which was definitely enough for Eggy to advance to Heavenly God level.","But Eggy continued to refine the origin energies without assimilating them.","...","By the time Chu Feng reached the sacred item, he was already brought up to date about the situation.","He learned that the sacred item had played an important role in confirming Chu Feng’s identity as the Netherworld Master’s grandson. Still, it was a different matter to witness it in person.","The most excited person was still the Netherworld Envoy, especially after confirming that he was neither dreaming nor hallucinating.","“I didn’t expect Chu Feng to be Lord Netherworld Master’s descendant.”","When he looked at the blood-red words above the sacred item and Chu Feng, his body began trembling uncontrollably, and tears streamed from his eyes. He was happy not because of the rewards he would receive, but that he had brought back the Netherworld Master’s descendant. He thought that there was no greater honor than that.","“Young master, we can construct a formation to strengthen your Netherworld Embryo,” Cang Li proposed.","“That’s not needed. Tell the others to step back.”","Cang Li relayed the order, and the Netherworld Sectmembers retreated. It was as if they had become spectators. Only Chu Feng stood before the gigantic black gate.","Boom!","Chu Feng took a step forward, and the black gate shook.","A shocking sight happened.","The black gate, which the Netherworld Sect had been desperately trying to open, began swiftly opening on its own accord. But before the crowd could see what was inside the gate, a powerful surge of blood-red aura gushed out from within.","The Netherworld Sectmembers wailed in agony.","Just coming into contact with the blood-red aura inflicted tremendous pain to the Netherworld Embryos, and the pain quickly spread to the rest of their body.","Those who were coping better, like Baili Xukong and the others, widened their eyes in shock. They endured the pain and continued keeping an eye on Chu Feng. They were worried about him and were ready to swoop in whenever needed to save him.","Yet, Chu Feng was perfectly fine even though he should have been in the most pain.","“Those who can’t withstand it can retreat further,” Chu Feng said.","“Retreat,” Baili Xukong ordered.","The further away they were from the door, the weaker the backlash they experienced. Experts like Baili Xukong, the six neutral elders, and Wuma Hanshuang didn’t need to retreat too much before they were no longer affected by the blood-red aura.","Most Netherworld Sectmembers had to retreat several hundred meters more before they could cope.","All of them looked at Chu Feng in awe. They shuddered to imagine the sheer pressure they would have to face if they were standing in Chu Feng’s position. They probably wouldn’t have been able to muster the energy to retreat.","“Our young master must have foreseen the change in the sacred item. That’s why he told us to retreat,” Ting Yun said.","“Ah? He’s able to foresee that as well?” Lie Shan blurted out in disbelief.","“Our young master’s capabilities transcend our imagination. He’s a different breed from us,” Cang Li said.","“Is this how it feels to be on the same side as our young master? It feels like we have found our backbone,” Jimo Qianzhou remarked.","Baili Xukong didn’t say a word, but he looked at Chu Feng with admiration.","Chu Feng stepped through the black gate and was transported into another space.","The space was desolate and devoid of life. There were countless stars, but none of them were shining. It resembled the Immemorial Cemetery, but it was even more eerie. The surroundings were not pitch-black but blood red.","A pair of humongous eyes suddenly opened in the distance and looked at Chu Feng.","Words couldn’t even begin to describe its size. It felt as if this space itself was its body.","“What a pity,” a powerful, deep voice reverberated.","It was the same voice that had berated Baili Xukong and the Netherworld Sectmembers when they previously attempted to awaken the sacred item."]},{"number":6710,"title":"Chapter 6710: Chapter 6708: Promise With the Mysterious Entity","paragraphs":["Chapter 6708: Promise With the Mysterious Entity","“Elder, are you Lord Netherworld God?”","It was a deduction from Chu Feng’s part.","He could tell that the other party was a true living entity and was extremely powerful, but his main body didn’t seem to be here. From that, he deduced that the other party was the rumored Netherworld God, and the sacred item was just a medium to reach the Netherworld God.","It just so happened that Chu Feng had come into contact with the Netherworld God’s power during the Netherworld God Bestowment’s trial. While the other party had concealed his aura well, Chu Feng still sensed familiarity from him.","His instincts were telling him that the other party was the legendary Netherworld God.","“It doesn’t matter who I am. You have to make a choice now,” the entity replied.","“A choice? Do I have to undergo a trial?” Chu Feng asked.","“That’s not it.” The entity refuted Chu Feng’s conjecture. “The Netherworld Embryo can be thought to be a bloodline itself; it is not just a supporting tool. Your Netherworld Embryo is close to perfection, and your body is capable of unleashing the Netherworld Embryo’s true prowess as well. However, you possess an even stronger bloodline. That’s why you have never tapped into the Netherworld Embryo’s power.”","In truth, Chu Feng also possessed the Four Symbols Divine Body, but because of the Dao of Specialization, he chose to focus on his Heavenly Lightning Bloodline. Due to that, his Heavenly Lightning Bloodline became exceptionally powerful.","“You aren’t a true Netherworld Sectmember, so why should I allow you to tap into the power sealed inside the gate?” the entity asked.","“Elder, I can relinquish the sacred item’s energy, but those outside are orthodox members of the Netherworld Sect,” Chu Feng said.","“Orthodox members? You’re talking about that half-assed bunch out there?” the entity sneered.","Chu Feng’s heart jolted. Something was wrong. This person looked down on all the Netherworld Sectmembers outside.","“They might have reached their current heights thanks to your grandfather, but this gate only appeared because of your grandfather’s formation and your appearance,” the entity said.","“Chu Feng, this fellow is after you,” Eggy said.","Chu Feng had also made sense of the situation. The Netherworld Sectmembers could have never awakened the sacred item, for it had appeared because of him. In other words, its target was him.","“Elder, what choice do I have to make?” Chu Feng asked.","“You won’t be able to use the energy stored inside the gate if you don’t use your Netherworld Embryo’s power, but this energy can indeed raise the cultivation of your people outside. Giving this energy to them benefits you as well. It’ll help you overcome your current ordeal. Since I am helping you, it’s only right for you to repay me,” the entity said.","“What do I have to do?” Chu Feng asked.","“I want you to do something for me.”","“What is it?”","“I haven’t decided yet. I’ll tell you when you come to the Ninth Galaxy.”","“All right.”","The entity laughed. “I don’t trust your promise.”","“How can I make you trust me?”","“Turn your Netherworld Embryo into poison. If you renege on your promise, it’ll claim your life,” the entity said.","“Don’t accept his promise!” Eggy exclaimed.","But Chu Feng nodded. “All right, I agree.”","He had his reasons for accepting the offer. In the first place, the other party could have easily killed him on the spot, which meant there was no place for Chu Feng to haggle. There was a chance that the entity had principles and wouldn’t make things hard for him even if he rejected the offer, but that would mean that he wouldn’t attain the sacred item’s power.","Without the sacred item’s power, he would have to pit his life against Jie Tianran, and that was likely to lead to his death. So, he had to obtain the sacred item’s power, no matter the cost.","Eggy was worried about Chu Feng, but no matter how he looked at it, it was more worthwhile to accept the offer.","Weng!","Two humongous blood-red formations that resembled skulls appeared in the distance. Their presence was extremely discomforting.","“Is he going to put those things into your Netherworld Embryo?” Chu Feng felt uneasy.","Those two formations were even larger than an average starfield; they must contain an unimaginable amount of power. Infusing that much power inside a small body could be fatal.","“It seems so.” Chu Feng nodded.","“Will you take one or both?” the entity asked.","“Can I choose that as well?”","It was obvious that Chu Feng would only choose one if he had a choice.","“If you choose one, you’ll have to do one thing for me in the future. If you choose both, you’ll have to do two things for me in the future,” the entity replied.","“Elder, will you only share a portion of the sacred item’s power with the Netherworld Sectmembers if I choose to take only one formation?” Chu Feng asked.","“I’ll give them all of the sacred item’s power, but your grandfather’s gu poison has permeated their souls. They are already under your grandfather’s control. Even if they become stronger, there are only two options for them. One is to commit suicide, and the other is to become your grandfather’s puppet and turn against you,” the entity replied.","“The hell! In the end, he’s still telling you to choose to take both formations!” Eggy was speechless.","Chu Feng had realized the dangers of the black bracelets, but he thought that he could find a solution. However, he didn’t think that this entity would lie to him. He might have underestimated Jie Tianran’s means.","“Elder, can you completely lift the gu poison if I choose to take on both formations?” Chu Feng asked.","“Hahahaha...” The entity burst into laughter before turning to Chu Feng. “What do you think?”","It was more than easy for someone of his stature to unravel Jie Tianran’s means.","“Elder, I shall owe you two favors,” Chu Feng said.","“Good.”","The two humongous formations simultaneously unleashed two blood-red pillars that gushed toward Chu Feng. The light pillars were initially larger than most realms, but they became increasingly smaller as they approached Chu Feng, eventually piercing into his Netherworld Embryo as two blood-red swords.","Chu Feng clenched his teeth. It was far more painful than he had imagined. His Netherworld Embryo was being deeply bound to his soul.","Unless someone of equivalent strength intervened, there was no way to separate his Netherworld Embryo from him. To put it in other words, the other party could now control Chu Feng’s life and death.","But Chu Feng didn’t regret his decision. He sensed the power in this world rousing like an awakened tide and racing out of the black gate."]},{"number":6711,"title":"Chapter 6711: Chapter 6709: Fighting for the Young Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 6709: Fighting for the Young Master","Outside the black gate, Baili Xukong and the other Netherworld Sectmembers saw a massive tide of blood-red aura gushing out from the sacred item. Before they could even react, they were already shrouded in the blood-red aura.","This time, they didn’t feel a stabbing pain in their Netherworld Embryos. Instead, their Netherworld Embryos began ravenously devouring the blood-red aura as if it was their favorite food.","Soon, blood-red clouds began gathering in the sky. The clouds were of different sizes, and a humongous pair of eyes could be seen among them. It was a phenomenon!","This was a phenomenon that appeared when Netherworld Sectmembers made a breakthrough.","Under the nourishment of the sacred item’s energy, many of the weaker Netherworld Sectmembers began making a breakthrough.","“It worked! Our young master succeeded!”","Even Baili Xukong couldn’t curb his excitement. He could already tell that he would make a breakthrough in his cultivation, but what excited him more was the elevation in his Netherworld Embryo. That should have been more difficult for him to control the Netherworld Embryo, but the energy deepened the bond between his soul and his Netherworld Embryo.","Not only did that raise his fighting prowess, but his future rate of cultivation would be increased as well.","This was a true metamorphosis.","Boom!","A massive blood-red cloud covered the sky. Baili Xukong had made a breakthrough to rank six Heavenly God level.","“Baili Xukong, you have reached rank six Heavenly God level?” Lie Shan asked.","“Indeed, Lord Lie Shan. You should be close to a breakthrough as well, right?” Baili Xukong replied cheerily.","But Lie Shan glared at him with gritted teeth. “You better hope that's the case, Baili Xukong. I’ll go after you if I fail to make a breakthrough. Don’t think that this is over yet. You still owe me my cultivation!”","Baili Xukong scratched his head awkwardly. Unless he sacrificed his life like Dongfang Hansong, there was no practical way for him to return the six neutral elders’ cultivation.","Baili Xukong had turned against the six neutral elders because he honestly thought that they had betrayed the Netherworld Sect. He was filled with shame after learning the truth.","He was willing to lay down his life for Chu Feng out of loyalty for the Netherworld Master, but just because he felt conscience-stricken toward the six neutral elders didn’t mean that he was willing to die for them. Just because he dared to die didn’t mean that he didn’t fear death.","If there was a choice to live well, who would choose death?","So, Baili Xukong could only pray that the six neutral elders would smoothly advance to rank six Heavenly God level, so that they wouldn’t go after him.","Some time later, the blood-red aura flowing from the sacred item weakened.","Wuma Hanshuang and Jimo Qianzhou made breakthroughs as well. Almost everyone had raised their cultivation, except for the six neutral elders.","Baili Xukong felt uneasy. Despite feeling better than ever, he was so nervous that his face was covered in sweat. It was clear to them that there was a limit to the energy inside the black gate. With the sacred item running out of energy, the six neutral elders might not be able to make a breakthrough.","Whoosh!","Fortunately, right before the sacred item’s energy dissipated, six massive blood-red clouds suddenly manifested in the sky. The six neutral elders had advanced to rank six Heavenly God level.","“Finally!” Baili Xukong breathed a sigh of relief.","The six neutral elders were overjoyed as well. Even Ting Yun was grinning so widely that the corners of his mouth nearly reached his ears.","“Hold on. It looks like the sacred item is about to dissipate.”","Someone noticed the black gate dissipating into smoke. It was happening slowly, but at this rate, it was only a matter of time before it disappeared.","“Our young master isn’t out yet.”","The Netherworld Sectmembers panicked. The dissipation of the sacred item was a small matter; they were worried that Chu Feng would disappear as well.","Just as they were about to barge in, Chu Feng stepped out from the black gate.","He suddenly stopped moving, and his eyes flickered around to take in the surrounding sights. He was observing Baili Xukong and the others. The sacred item had stopped releasing energy, but there were still massive congregations of blood-red auras shrouding Baili Xukong and the others.","The blood-red auras flowed like a ceaseless stream, and sparks would occasionally emerge from them. Chu Feng noticed a peculiar pattern in those sparks. It didn’t take long for him to decipher what it was.","As long as the blood-red auras lingered, the Netherworld Sectmembers could construct a massive Netherworld Embryo formation and exert even greater power through it.","Baili Xukong and the others also realized that something was hidden inside the blood-red auras, and that Chu Feng was deciphering it. So, they stood completely still, not daring to even breathe loudly lest they interrupt him.","It didn’t take long for Chu Feng to capture all the details. He figured out how to construct, channel, and even control the formation through his Netherworld Embryo. On top of that, it wouldn’t interfere with his Dao of Specialization if he was just controlling a formation.","So, he walked up to Baili Xukong and the others and said, “Congratulations on your breakthroughs.”","Baili Xukong and the other Netherworld Sectmembers fell to their knees and said, “Thank you, young master.”","They were earnestly grateful to Chu Feng. They knew that they wouldn’t have been able to undergo this metamorphosis if not for him. This deepened their loyalty toward Chu Feng. They weren’t following him just because he was the Netherworld Master’s descendant anymore.","They did not doubt that the Netherworld Sect would rise to greater heights under Chu Feng’s leadership.","“You need not thank me yet, for I have a request to make,” Chu Feng said.","“Young master, feel free to command us as you please,” Baili Xukong replied.","“Indeed, young master. You don’t need to request anything from us. We will unconditionally follow your orders,” Jimo Qianzhou added.","“Young master, is this regarding Jie Tianran?”","“That’s right.” Chu Feng nodded.","Even though the Netherworld Sect had massacred the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion, that was done of their own volition, and the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s members they had faced were weaker than them.","But the same couldn’t be said about Jie Tianran. Even by himself, he was on par with a rank seven Heavenly Dragon World Spiritist, which was enough to face the Netherworld Sect’s army.","And if he could tap into God’s Era’s power, even the Netherworld Sect’s army would prove inadequate against him. It would be a hopeless battle.","“Young master, our lives belong to you. It’s our honor to fight for you,” Baili Xukong said as he dropped to his knees and kowtowed. “Young master, please allow us to fight for you!”","The other Netherworld Sectmembers kneeled to Chu Feng and echoed those words, “Young master, please allow us to fight for you!”"]},{"number":6712,"title":"Chapter 6712: Chapter 6710: Ambushing Him","paragraphs":["Chapter 6710: Ambushing Him","“Very well. Please fight alongside me,” Chu Feng declared.","The Netherworld Sectmembers cheered in frenzied joy.","Chu Feng was moved. No one in their right mind would beg others to risk their life, but the Netherworld Sectmembers were such a group of people. It was not that they were fools; their loyalty simply weighed more heavily than anything else.","“Chu Feng, your grandfather must have been pretty capable. He turned the Netherworld Sectmembers into loyal dogs,” Eggy complimented. Her metaphor was awful, but her words carried grains of truth.","“Indeed. I am benefiting from his halo,” Chu Feng replied with a smile.","This was an army that would fight to the death for his grandfather, and Chu Feng had inherited this legacy.","“The auras shrouding you contain a formation that can further our fighting prowess. I’ll teach you how to construct the formation now,” Chu Feng said.","He began drawing a formation blueprint to illustrate what he intended to do. He didn’t reveal the fact that Jie Tianran had planted a gu in the Netherworld Sectmembers; there was no need to make them indebted to him, since they were already doing more than enough now.","Just then, the mysterious voice echoed from the sacred item, which was on the verge of dissipation, “Chu Feng, I lifted their gu poison and saved their lives for you. You owe me one. Don’t forget about that. Look for me even if I don’t find you, or else you might just lose your life.”","The voice continued to reverberate in space even as the black gate dissipated into thin air.","“That fellow has a big mouth, but I like it.” Eggy revealed a satisfied smile.","Chu Feng was not senile. It was unnecessary for the person in the black gate to remind Chu Feng about his promise. That person merely wanted to let the Netherworld Sectmembers know that Chu Feng had saved their lives.","The Netherworld Sectmembers were stunned. All of them turned to Chu Feng.","“What happened, young master?” many asked.","Baili Xukong looked at the black bracelets on his wrists and murmured, “Did Jie Tianran plant a gu poison on the bracelets to kill us?”","“Come to think about it, the backlash from the black bracelets seems to be gone.”","“You’re right!”","Most of the Netherworld Sectmembers realized that the terrifying energy that seeped from the black bracelets into their souls had vanished. The upper echelons, such as Baili Xukong, Cang Li, and the others, had already noticed that, but...","“The backlash didn’t vanish because of the sacred item’s awakening or our Netherworld Embryos’ strengthening? You were the one who saved us, young master? What did you agree to for our sake?” Cang Li anxiously asked.","“I agreed to do two things for that person, though the details remain unknown. I didn’t have to pay a price for it,” Chu Feng replied.","“Impossible! Young master, please tell us the truth,” the Netherworld Sectmembers urged.","They weren’t concerned about the identity of the person behind the voice. They were all worried about the price Chu Feng had to pay to save them.","“I didn’t lie to you. Aren’t I alive and kicking right now? It’ll be fine once I fulfill two requests for that person,” Chu Feng replied with a smile.","“Young master, who’s the person speaking to us from the sacred item? Is it our ancestor or...” Ting Yun asked. He turned his attention toward the entity inside the sacred item when he saw that Chu Feng refused to speak the truth.","“I don’t know who that person is, but my guess is the Netherworld God,” Chu Feng replied.","“Lord Netherworld God? Does Lord Netherworld God really exist?”","The crowd looked shocked and excited at the same time. They had always viewed the Netherworld God as a legend and a symbol, but they also thought that the Netherworld God no longer existed in this world.","It would be good news if the Netherworld God were still around. This meant that the Netherworld Sect had plenty of room to grow!","“I don’t know if that person is truly Lord Netherworld God, but he has asked me to fulfill two requests for him in the Ninth Galaxy,” Chu Feng replied.","That further stoked the Netherworld Sectmembers.","“We can talk more about that in the future. Let’s focus on the present right now. Jie Tianran will be arriving soon,” Chu Feng said as he glanced at the observation formation.","God’s Era was moving at an alarming speed. Despite having to cross galaxies, it wouldn’t be long before it arrived here.","Chu Feng quickly drew up a formation blueprint. It was complicated, but the Netherworld Sectmembers swiftly grasped its crux after he broke it down for them. Then, he proceeded to distribute work.","Chu Feng played a vital role in this formation despite having no blood-red aura, as he was the only one who could take in everyone’s blood-red aura.","So, the Netherworld Sectmembers began constructing the formation.","Blood-red auras flared from the Netherworld Sectmembers, but instead of converging into an individual to empower him, they interweaved to connect all Netherworld Sectmembers into one entity.","The sheer number of Netherworld Sectmembers present easily spanned the size of a smaller realm when gathered. As they channeled the formation, their blood-red auras blazed fervently as they swiftly expanded until they resembled a mini sun.","At the same time, the congregation of blood-red auras began growing hair, a nose, and eyes, transforming into a blurry, humongous head that emanated an imposing air. It was rather eerie to see a single head floating in the middle of space.","“What a powerful formation! I can’t even imagine how powerful it can become if we construct it in its entirety. We might even raise our cultivation!”","The Netherworld Sectmembers were excited. Even though this was their first time coming into contact with this formation, they could also see its ingenuity. In fact, the formation they had just constructed was limited by their own capabilities; the formation itself was capable of much more.","The complete formation would have formed a terrifying congregation of power capable of even stomping out stars.","“Come, Jie Tianran. So what if you have grasped God’s Era? We’ll show you what our Netherworld Sect is capable of!”","Many Netherworld Sectmembers were filled with confidence.","The formation only raised their fighting prowess within the rank seven Heavenly God level—it didn’t further raise their maximum cultivation level to rank eight Heavenly God level—but they believed that it granted them the power to stand face-to-face against God’s Era.","“The formation might have bolstered our strength, but the odds are still stacked against us. Even if Jie Tianran is unable to truly wield God’s Era’s power, his strength is still nothing to scoff at. We should avoid a frontal confrontation with him.”","Chu Feng’s words quelled the Netherworld Sectmembers’ desire to go head-to-head against Jie Tianran.","“What should we do, young master?” Baili Xukong asked.","“We’ll ambush him,” Chu Feng replied.","“Ambush him?”","The crowd was confused. This formation was even larger than that of a realm; how could they spring an ambush on anyone like that? Chu Feng had to elaborate on his plan before the crowd nodded in realization.","“I’ll hide inside the formation. Jie Tianran shouldn’t be able to find me. Don’t reveal your relationship with me just yet. Pretend that you have massacred the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion to become the sole powerhouse of the world of cultivation.","“If Jie Tianran isn’t confident of defeating you, he will resort to controlling you via the gu poison. You can feign obedience to make him lower his guard before ambushing him,” Chu Feng said."]},{"number":6713,"title":"Chapter 6713: Chapter 6711: A Battle of Nerves","paragraphs":["Chapter 6711: A Battle of Nerves","Chu Feng analyzed the black bracelets to deduce how the Netherworld Sectmembers ought to react when they were under the effects of the gu poison.","...","Jie Tianran was still standing on the pedestal.","God’s Era was moving so fast that it flitted across countless realms in an instant. He felt like a god who dictated the life and death of the masses. Yet, instead of looking happy, he had a grim expression.","He knew that he had nothing to do with God’s Era’s movement. In fact, he had even dispelled his observation formation to contemplate the current situation.","Why was God’s Era heading to the Bloodline Galaxy, where the phenomenon was? He had previously suspected that the phenomenon was one of Chu Feng’s hands. He couldn’t help but wonder if God’s Era was looking for Chu Feng.","That didn’t bode well, as he hadn’t obtained God’s Era’s final power yet.","The more he thought about it, the more anxious he felt.","That made him more desperate to grasp God’s Era’s power, as that was the only way he could dispel his worries. Under his relentless effort, he found a way out. He was confident that as long as he grasped the power before him, Chu Feng would be dead meat.","Over a thousand talisman papers floated around the pedestals, revolving under Jie Tianran’s control. The spirit power emanated by each of these talisman papers would shock anyone. He was constructing an extremely potent formation.","“Jie Tianran, you’re going to empty your coffers at this rate. You’ll lose big if God’s Era doesn’t at least give you something equivalent in exchange,” the old entity inside Jie Tianran’s body said.","These talisman papers were powerful, but they didn’t come easily.","That was why he constantly reminded himself that these talisman papers were one-time consumables and that he shouldn’t be reliant on them. Unless he was truly cornered, he wouldn’t resort to these talisman papers or the Ancient Era’s treasures.","But in the end, he had still grown reliant on the talisman papers and had begun using them unreservedly. He even ignored the advice from the old entity inside him. It was not that he didn’t hear the old entity, but he didn’t want to be distracted from whatever he was doing.","He had to succeed no matter the cost.","Pu pu pu!","The thousand talisman papers simultaneously ignited into flames, forming a formation that revolved around the pedestal. He had finally activated the formation. As long as he succeeded in the activation, he would be able to attain the power he sought.","“You actually did it. Well done,” the old entity praised.","Jie Tianran’s formation was extremely difficult to construct. It was still unknown whether the activation would be a success or not, but this was a good start.","Jie Tianran also exhaled in relief. “Elder, I am truly scared.”","“Scared?” The old entity was taken aback. It was rare for the proud Jie Tianran to use such a term. “What are you scared of?”","“The more I understand God’s Era, the more unfathomable it feels to me. If I can grasp it, even if my spirit power doesn’t surge right away, I have no doubt that my future will be bright,” Jie Tianran said.","“But stronger powers tend to be more difficult to conquer,” the old entity pointed out.","“Yes. That is why I fail to ascend to the throne no matter how hard I try,” Jie Tianran sighed.","“So, what are you scared about?”","“Strong powers share a common trait—they proactively seek their masters. Chu Feng has already failed the trial, but God’s Era is still moving toward him. Is this really a coincidence?”","“You suspect that God’s Era’s final power is seeking Chu Feng?”","“Yes, that’s what I think.”","“ Haaa! ” The old entity sighed. “Jie Tianran, it is evident that your grandson has become your inner demon.”","“But don’t you find it baffling that God’s Era is moving toward the phenomenon, of all places? How can there be such a coincidence?”","“Let’s assume that you’re right. Doesn’t that mean that everything you are doing right now is meaningless? Why squander so many treasures to continue wooing God’s Era’s final power?”","“While I have my doubts, I can’t give up just like that. I can only pray that I’m thinking too much into it.”","“Don’t overthink it. Isn’t your grandson trapped near the phenomenon right now? His barrier won’t last for much longer. Just kill him, and everything will be settled.”","The old entity’s words knocked some sense into Jie Tianran. He thought about his subordinates, but the next moment, his eyes widened in horror.","He anxiously pulled out several hundred life tokens with a wave of his sleeves. These were the life tokens of the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s top experts, the subordinates he had sent to the Bloodline Galaxy to curb Chu Feng.","Everything had shattered.","Jie Tianran hurriedly constructed an observation formation. He was now close enough to the Bloodline Galaxy to clearly see the situation over at the phenomenon. The phenomenon looked the same as before, though the gate seemed to be on the verge of opening.","But that was not what he was concerned about.","Much to his horror, he found not a single member from the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion in the vicinity. Instead, a huge, blood-red head floated in the middle of space, looking sinister and menacing.","He was too far away to scrutinize the details of the head, but he could already tell that it was the Netherworld Sect’s means.","“The Netherworld Sect?”","A cold glint flashed across Jie Tianran’s eyes. He could already guess what had happened.","Meanwhile, Chu Feng and the others were also surveying God’s Era’s movements with an observation formation.","The quakes reverberating through the world of cultivation were intensifying. Even with their bare eyes, they could already see God’s Era’s silhouette in the distance. It moved so fast that in just a few steps, the silhouette had grown from a distant figure into a humongous entity that towered over them.","Before God’s Era’s silhouette, the Netherworld Sect’s formation was insignificant like an ant. Even the sectmembers who had thought that they could stand face to face against Jie Tianran lost their confidence.","“Baili Xukong, where is Chu Feng?” Jie Tianran’s voice echoed from the top of God’s Era.","Despite not having grasped God’s Era’s final power, he still put on airs as if he had conquered it. His demeanor was so convincing that even Chu Feng was worried.","We won’t stand a chance at all if Jie Tianran has really grasped God’s Era’s final power."]},{"number":6714,"title":"Chapter 6714: Chapter 6712: Am I Dreaming?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6712: Am I Dreaming?","Jie Tianran had asked about Chu Feng first instead of his missing subordinates. It was the worst-case scenario for him—God’s Era had stopped right before the phenomenon that seemed inexplicably linked to Chu Feng.","And he could sense the location of Chu Feng’s sword key; Chu Feng was in the area.","Yet, he couldn’t find Chu Feng anywhere.","“Mansion Master, you seem more concerned about Chu Feng despite having lost so many subordinates. Your people must not hold any weight in your heart,” Baili Xukong remarked from the bottom of his heart.","He noticed that Jie Tianran was angry but not upset. Even his anger was driven by Baili Xukong’s betrayal and not the deaths of his subordinates.","“Have you been making use of me, Baili Xukong?” Jie Tianran asked.","“You have been using us as well. Our interests merely aligned then,” Baili Xukong replied.","“Hah...” Jie Tianran sneered. “I see you harbor wild ambitions, but are you able to shoulder the weight?”","He formed a hand seal.","The faces of Baili Xukong and the others distorted, and they writhed in pain. Moments later, most Netherworld Sectmembers froze in place and stopped moving. Only Baili Xukong and a few other Netherworld Marshals continued to struggle.","Soon, Jimo Qianzhou, Wuma Hanshuang, and the neutral elders stopped moving as well. Even Baili Xukong didn’t last long before standing completely still.","The entire Netherworld Sect stood perfectly still like statues, maintaining their last positions. They only retained movement over their eyeballs. Some were horrified, whereas others were infuriated.","“Oh? I didn’t expect the Netherworld Sect to be so good at acting,” Eggy said while chuckling.","The Netherworld Sectmembers’ gu poison had been lifted. They were merely following Chu Feng’s instructions. Even at this instant, Chu Feng was intently observing Jie Tianran’s hand seals, analyzing the latter’s intention and relaying instructions to the Netherworld Sectmembers to let them know how they should react.","Oblivious to the truth, Jie Tianran smirked in glee.","“Did you think that I wouldn’t prepare a hand against you? Even if you didn’t betray me, I’d have still turned you all into my puppets.”","Jie Tianran changed his hand seal, and the Netherworld Sectmembers could no longer move their eyes.","“Speak, Baili Xukong. Where did Chu Feng go?” Jie Tianran asked.","“He entered the phenomenon,” Baili Xukong replied.","“The gate isn’t open yet. How can he enter the phenomenon?”","“He opened a spirit formation gate. It’s right there.” Baili Xukong pointed to a location not too far away. Of course, he was just saying whatever Chu Feng told him to.","Jie Tianran feared Chu Feng; that was evident in how his very first question upon arriving was about Chu Feng’s whereabouts. Chu Feng knew that and was using it to lure Jie Tianran closer.","And Jie Tianran, confident in his gu poison, didn’t doubt Baili Xukong’s words.","God’s Era had stopped a considerable distance away. To get to the spirit formation gate as quickly as possible, Jie Tianran unleashed the full prowess of his spirit power and plastered a talisman paper on himself to further raise his speed.","While making his way over, he took out another talisman paper to construct an observation formation. The formation was completed before he arrived at his destination. He adjusted the observation formation to lock onto the location pinpointed by Baili Xukong.","He didn’t pay any attention to Baili Xukong and the others; his focus was solely on the observation formation.","“Elder, please help me take a look. Why can’t I see anything peculiar about the spirit formation gate?”","Jie Tianran continued to examine the spirit formation gate while making his way closer. To his dismay, he was unable to find any hidden formations in the area, so he sought help from the old entity inside him.","Boom!","Just then, a deluge of blood-red aura instantly crashed down on Jie Tianran like a vast ocean.","It was the head formation constructed by the Netherworld Sect! Its mouth had opened and was unleashing a powerful beam of blood-red aura, but the beam was so much wider than a human body that it resembled a vast ocean.","Jie Tianran’s observation formation instantly disintegrated before this power, but Jie Tianran remained safe and sound.","Countless runes floated around him, forming a barrier.","“A protective means? That old thing is indeed not that easy to deal with.” Chu Feng was not surprised by the failure of the ambush, though he still felt regretful.","The Netherworld Sect’s ambush was a success, but Jie Tianran had too many formidable treasures on him.","Shoosh!","Jie Tianran flung his sleeve. A powerful surge of spirit power gushed out like a tsunami, dissipating the blood-red aura shrouding him. But by then, the rune barrier protecting him had already started to crack.","He quickly reached into his robe to pull out a round token.","This token emanated the Ancient Era’s aura, and the runes inscribed on it were identical to the ones on the barrier. However, it was cracked just like the barrier.","As Chu Feng had guessed, this was Jie Tianran’s life-preservation means. It would automatically activate when Jie Tianran was faced with a lethal attack to protect him, but like the Heaven Protection Shield Spirit, it could only be used once.","Jie Tianran didn’t expect to lose his secret hand just like that. His unease and worry had vanished in the face of sheer rage. Intense killing intent flared from him, distorting the surrounding space. It was as if the god of massacre had descended upon the world.","“You lifted my gu poison,” Jie Tianran hissed through gritted teeth.","Despite Jie Tianran’s murderous glare, Baili Xukong and the Netherworld Sect stood unfazed. Their eyes flared with killing intent as well.","“Jie Tianran, I’ll tell you the truth. We didn’t plan to turn against the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion. We had to kill your people because we had no choice but to do so. The person whom you desperately wanted to eliminate is our Netherworld Sect’s young master,” Baili Xukong said.","Those words made Jie Tianran’s reddened eyes clear once more. What he had heard was so ridiculous that he wondered if he had heard wrongly. He simply had to seek confirmation.","“What did you just say? Who is your young master?”","“Chu Feng is our Netherworld Sect’s young master,” Baili Xukong declared.","Jie Tianran’s eyes flickered. No one could tell what he was thinking, but his expression made it clear that his mind was rattled. What he said next reflected that.","“Am I dreaming?”"]},{"number":6715,"title":"Chapter 6715: Chapter 6713: Revealing Strength","paragraphs":["Chapter 6713: Revealing Strength","A storm was brewing in Jie Tianran’s head. His first thought was that Baili Xukong was lying.","Even if he overlooked the grudge between Chu Feng and the Netherworld Sect, there was also the fact that Chu Feng was from the weak Ancestral Martial Galaxy’s Chu Heavenly Clan. There was absolutely no connection between that and the Netherworld Sect.","How could Chu Feng be the Netherworld Sect’s young master?","But when he sensed the killing intent overflowing from the Netherworld Sectmembers and saw the hateful glares from them as if he had killed their fathers, he instinctively knew that it was the truth.","He might have schemed against the Netherworld Sect, but that shouldn’t warrant such overwhelming enmity. On top of that, it was an unwise decision for the Netherworld Sect to confront him right now, especially when they thought that he had grasped God’s Era’s power.","Anyone with a sound mind would have fled right away. There was no reason for the Netherworld Sect to be waiting around for him.","The only conclusion that made sense here was that Chu Feng was truly the Netherworld Sect’s young master.","“Have you been acting all this while to fool me?” Jie Tianran asked.","Before anyone could answer his question, he snickered.","“Hah... It doesn’t matter.”","A black aura gushed out from Jie Tianran. It was not coming from his body but his robe, his wrists, his waist, and his accessories. He had concealed treasures in those places. Ironically, he looked aligned with the Netherworld Sect more than ever.","His righteous facade had completely vanished.","“Your grandfather’s world spiritist treasures appear different from those from the Celestial Master Sacred Sect.” Eggy was confused.","They had already learned that Jie Tianran had plundered all the Celestial Master Sacred Sect’s world spiritist treasures and distributed them to the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s elders.","Naturally, it made sense that Jie Tianran would take some of them as well.","But somehow, Jie Tianran’s treasures looked different.","“Those aren’t the Celestial Master Sacred Sect’s treasures. Jie Tianran must have crafted them himself,” Chu Feng replied.","Boom!","The Netherworld Sect’s formation spewed another breath of blood-red aura.","This time, Jie Tianran was guarded against it. Even though he was extremely close to the formation, he activated a speed enhancement formation and disappeared. When he finally reappeared, he was already in the sky.","“Chu Feng is hiding inside that formation, right? It doesn’t matter what your relationship with him is. It also doesn’t matter what kind of tricks you are pulling. You are all going to die anyway.”","Jie Tianran reached into his Cosmos Sack and pulled out a black saber that emitted bloodthirst. With his saber in hand, his fighting prowess rose to a higher level.","In terms of auras, Jie Tianran didn’t pale in comparison to the Netherworld Sect’s formation.","“That grandfather of yours is quite the difficult figure to deal with.” Eggy frowned.","In hindsight, they had never seen Jie Tianran going all out before. This was the first time he was revealing his true strength.","The Netherworld Sect was stronger than ever. Their members were united, and they had just been buffed by the sacred item.","Yet, Jie Tianran rivaled them alone. This showed just how terrifyingly powerful he was. He lived up to his reputation as the strongest expert in the world of cultivation.","Meanwhile, Baili Xukong looked at Jie Tianran’s black saber with a look of regret.","“The Demonslayer Saber.”","The Demonslayer Saber was an unparalleled world spiritist treasure that greatly enhanced a world spiritist’s fighting prowess. Baili Xukong had given it to Jie Tianran as a token of sincerity to secure his cooperation back then. He didn’t expect it to be used against them now.","“Someone will indeed die today, Jie Tianran, but it won’t be our Netherworld Sect or our young master,” Baili Xukong sneered.","The chilling wails filled the air as countless blood skeletons charged out from the formation like a massive army rushing at Jie Tianran.","“Hmph.” Jie Tianran harrumphed.","He formed a hand seal, and a powerful wave of spirit power rippled outward.","But the blood skeletons possessed a unique power that blocked Jie Tianran’s formation, so the spirit power was neutralized with ease.","Jie Tianran didn’t panic.","He waited for the blood skeletons to arrive before calmly brandishing the Demonslayer Saber. While the blood skeletons were impervious to his spirit power, the Demonslayer Saber sliced through them with ease.","He gracefully cut down any blood skeleton that approached him. His movements resembled a powerful cultivator more than a world spiritist. Who could have expected Jie Tianran to be so skilled in close-quarter combat as well?","But Jie Tianran didn’t just passively defend himself from the blood skeletons.","He pulled out a copper mirror and floated it around him. The copper mirror unleashed an intense light beam into the Netherworld Sect’s formation. It was searching for Chu Feng’s whereabouts.","Unfortunately, the mirror’s intense light was not enough to reveal Chu Feng.","Jie Tianran remained unfazed. He took out a talisman paper and fused it into the copper mirror.","The copper mirror’s light beam receded. Several runes appeared and began to revolve around the mirror.","Baili Xukong and the others could tell that the copper mirror was gathering energy to unleash an even stronger means.","“What is Jie Tianran planning? Why is he so determined to find you? Even if he finds you, it is meaningless if he fails to breach the Netherworld Sect’s formation?” Eggy was confused by Jie Tianran’s actions.","“That copper mirror isn’t an observation treasure but an offensive treasure. He was putting on an act to make the Netherworld Sectmembers underestimate the copper mirror’s prowess. The next light beam from the copper mirror will be a devastating attack,” Chu Feng explained.","He also relayed the same message to the Netherworld Sectmembers’ upper echelons before instructing them to feign offense for the time being to preserve the formation’s energy.","Half of the energy would be used to deal with Jie Tianran’s incoming attack, whereas the other half would be used to attack God’s Era’s pedestal.","Chu Feng could tell that the formation shrouding God’s Era’s pedestal was important to Jie Tianran. Even if their attack failed to destroy the formation, it would at least distract Jie Tianran.","After issuing his instructions, Chu Feng suddenly sighed.","“What’s wrong? Haven’t you already planned everything out?” Eggy asked.","“Even though I was the one who provided the blueprint for this formation, in truth, I haven’t completely grasped it, either. It’s still up to Baili Xukong and the others to control it. That greatly limits my observation prowess,” Chu Feng replied with a sigh.","As much as the Netherworld Sect had yet to go all out against Jie Tianran, the latter was clearly not cornered yet. He definitely had more tricks up his sleeve."]},{"number":6716,"title":"Chapter 6716: Chapter 6714: Criticism That Reaches the Heart","paragraphs":["Chapter 6714: Criticism That Reaches the Heart","“Chu Feng, you don’t have to worry too much about them. They will also die if we lose this battle,” Eggy said.","Chu Feng could have taken control of this formation, but that would have changed the nature of this formation. The current formation was already complete, but it wasn’t in the most ideal state to draw out its full prowess.","The only way to draw out the full prowess of the formation was to use Chu Feng’s Netherworld Embryo as a medium to amplify the formation’s energy. However, there was a huge downside to doing so—it would sap the Netherworld Sectmembers’ life force.","That was why Chu Feng instructed Baili Xukong to channel the formation instead of doing it himself.","“The price is too heavy. If it’s possible, I’d like to avoid doing so,” Chu Feng replied.","He knew that the Netherworld Sectmembers were willing to lay down their lives for him, but there was no reason to expend their life force if they could already win this fight with normal means.","Weng!","Just then, Jie Tianran’s copper mirror unleashed another brilliant beam of light toward the Netherworld Sect’s formation. It looked as if Jie Tianran was merely searching for Chu Feng’s whereabouts once more.","But when the light beam landed, the Netherworld Sect’s formation rattled. Shockwaves rippled through the formation head.","Chu Feng was right. The copper mirror was charging up for an offensive move.","“It’s a good thing you saw through his trick, young master. Otherwise, we would have been in a spot.”","Baili Xukong and the others were glad that they had listened to Chu Feng’s commands and made preparations to defend against Jie Tianran’s move in advance. Otherwise, they would have channeled too much energy into offense, and that would have left the formation vulnerable to this attack.","Thanks to their preparations, Jie Tianran’s devastating attack only left some cracks on their formation. The Netherworld Sect easily repaired those cracks by channeling their energies.","“They were guarded against this?” Jie Tianran was taken aback.","Boom!","A blood-red light beam gushed from the Netherworld Sect’s formation. This attack was far stronger than the previous ones, but it wasn’t aimed at Jie Tianran but the formation around God’s Era’s pedestal.","“Damn it!”","Jie Tianran panicked. He anxiously activated a talisman paper to raise his movement speed, so that he could race after the blood-red light beam.","However, the blood-red light beam moved so fast that Jie Tianran was unable to stop it, no matter how he chased after it.","“It looks like he can’t protect that formation using God’s Era’s power. That’s good news.”","Baili Xukong and the others had been worried that God’s Era’s power would protect Jie Tianran’s formation. If so, Jie Tianran could simply hide inside God’s Era if he lost the battle, and the Netherworld Sect wouldn’t be able to do anything about him.","But Jie Tianran’s reaction told them that their worry was unfounded.","If Jie Tianran couldn’t use God’s Era’s formation to protect his formation, it was unlikely that he could use it to protect himself.","When the blood-red light beam came into contact with God’s Era’s silhouette, it passed through it without any obstruction and raced straight toward the formation around the pedestal.","But before it could strike the formation, a barrier suddenly appeared out of nowhere and stopped the blood-red light pillar. That barrier wasn’t from God’s Era; it was a barrier that Jie Tianran had prepared in advance, just that he had concealed it.","The blood-red light pillar turned into spirit power and dissipated.","“Oh no! That’s a formation clone!” Chu Feng anxiously warned Baili Xukong and the others, but it was too late.","A brilliant golden light appeared behind the Netherworld Sect’s formation.","It was Jie Tianran, but he looked very different from before. He was wrapped in golden spirit power that manifested in the form of a ten-thousand-meter-tall avatar. He looked insignificant in the face of the Netherworld Sect’s formation, but he emanated a lofty, divine air.","Needless to say, his fighting prowess was also stronger than before.","He swung his saber, slicing through the defenses of the Netherworld Sect’s formation with ease. Then, his saber emanated a brilliant light.","He had embedded a slaughter formation in the saber.","Countless light blades shot forth from his saber, reducing Netherworld Sectmembers into pools of bloody water before they could even scream in agony.","Baili Xukong and the others quickly channeled the formation’s energy to flee into the distance. At the same time, they also repaired the part of the formation where Jie Tianran had breached.","However, the formation had sustained significant damage and was nowhere near as strong as before.","“Hahahaha!” Instead of giving chase, Jie Tianran laughed frenziedly. “Was Chu Feng commanding you? It’s like that little bastard to fight in such a despicable manner. However, it looks like I have come out on top. Both the copper mirror and God’s Era’s formation are feints. My aim is merely to wait for you to reveal an opening before striking.","“Chu Feng, you’re only capable of underhanded tricks. You aren’t a match for me when it comes down to it,” Jie Tianran sneered.","He looked extremely gleeful. It was rare for him to lose himself, but he couldn’t help but get emotional when dealing with Chu Feng. His hatred for Chu Feng was simply too deep. He felt that only by venting his emotions would he be able to overcome his inner demons.","“How shameless can you get, Jie Tianran? Look at the disparity in your ages and cultivation levels. It’s my first time seeing someone acting so smug for taking advantage of a child,” Jimo Qianzhou spat.","Chu Feng was surprised. He had never expected to see such a side to Jimo Qianzhou.","Jie Tianran’s face darkened. He couldn’t refute Jimo Qianzhou’s words. There was a huge difference in his and Chu Feng’s cultivation levels and ages. He was really bullying a child here. Jimo Qianzhou’s words were true."]},{"number":6717,"title":"Chapter 6717: Chapter 6715: The Day Has Finally Come","paragraphs":["Chapter 6715: The Day Has Finally Come","But Jie Tianran would never admit to that.","“Chu Feng wouldn’t have been a match for me even if he were at the same cultivation level, though that day will never come now,” Jie Tianran sneered.","Boom!","Countless blood-red skeleton hands suddenly whizzed forth from the Netherworld Sect’s formation and engulfed Jie Tianran like an arrow rain.","It should have been impossible for Jie Tianran to dodge this attack, but he deactivated his formation, causing his avatar to disappear and leaving only his smaller main body behind.","He moved with amazing alacrity, weaving through the dense rain of blood-red skeleton hands with ease.","“Jie Tianran, you speak big words, but it looks like you can only dart around like a lowly rat,” Baili Xukong snorted in anger.","This attack was much stronger than the previous ones, and it resulted in the swift depletion of their energies. The weaker Netherworld Sectmembers felt their bodies going into disarray, with some even bleeding from their eyes, nostrils, ears, and mouth. They were getting desperate.","But Jie Tianran was unfazed by their attacks. This frustrated Baili Xukong.","“Hahahaha!” Jie Tianran laughed in contempt. “You said that I only know how to dodge? I’m merely giving you a chance. You only have your own incompetence to blame for failing to land your attacks.”","Then, Jie Tianran suddenly vanished.","Boom!","The blood-red skeleton hands seemed to have struck an invisible wall, causing them to stop in place and disintegrate.","Then, a golden light shone from where the blood-red skeleton hands had stopped. A formation palm appeared. It was so huge that it was comparable to the Netherworld Sect’s formation, but what was even more shocking was that there was a glowing figure behind that palm.","It was Jie Tianran’s avatar!","He stood many times taller than the Netherworld Sect’s formation. Even those from nearby starfields could see him without relying on observation means.","Jie Tianran thrust his palm toward the Netherworld Sect’s formation.","Despite the massive size of his avatar, he moved even faster than before.","Boom!","There was an intense spatial jolt that shook even the surrounding starfields.","Jie Tianran’s palm landed squarely on target. It failed to destroy the head, but it rattled the formation. Many Netherworld Sectmembers spewed fresh blood. Some even fainted.","“Something is off. Jie Tianran’s fighting prowess is clearly superior to that of the Netherworld Sect’s formation.”","Chu Feng belatedly realized that Jie Tianran had been feigning weakness. What he was seeing now was Jie Tianran’s true strength. In a face-off, the Netherworld Sect’s formation was not a match for him at all.","Jie Tianran was stronger than Chu Feng had expected.","“Jie Tianran is actually that powerful?”","Even Netherworld Marshals like Jimo Qianzhou were plunged into despair, let alone the others. Their Netherworld Embryos had already undergone metamorphosis after absorbing the sacred item’s energy, and they were currently buffed by the Netherworld Sect’s formation.","Yet, they still couldn’t see any hope for victory.","Jie Tianran was truly the strongest man in the present world of cultivation. The Netherworld Sect was no match for him!","“Heed my order, Netherworld Sectmembers. Spare no energy in channeling the formation! We shall fight for the young master!” Baili Xukong roared.","Despite being gripped by fear, the Netherworld Sectmembers continued to channel the formation. They released even greater energy from their Netherworld Embryos, but on top of that, they also began channeling another formidable power.","With that, the Netherworld Sect’s formation grew even stronger. The formation released a wave of oppressive might, which forced Jie Tianran’s avatar to retreat several steps.","“Are you pitting your life against mine? What a pity. There is nothing you can do in the face of absolute power,” Jie Tianran sneered. He remained fearless even though the Netherworld Set’s formation had grown even stronger than before.","He could tell that the Netherworld Sectmembers were putting their lives on the line to channel the formation. No matter how powerful the formation was, it wouldn’t last long. He just needed to drag things out, and the Netherworld Sect would collapse in due time.","Besides, he didn’t fear the Netherworld Sect in a direct confrontation.","“Please entrust the formation to me,” Chu Feng suddenly said.","He spoke aloud, such that even Jie Tianran heard his words loud and clear.","At the same time, Chu Feng appeared in the middle of the Netherworld Sect formation.","“Chu Feng!” Jie Tianran’s eyes ignited with animosity.","He unhesitatingly swung his saber down. Even the sheer shockwave of the attack was enough to destroy a realm.","Yet, when the attack landed, the Netherworld Sect’s formation didn’t budge in the least.","Jie Tianran hurriedly took another look at the Netherworld Sect’s formation. It was no longer in the form of a head but a blood-colored wind. The Netherworld Sectmembers had channeled all their energy toward Chu Feng, causing the formation to revolve around him.","Boom!","Jie Tianran was suddenly jolted off into the distance.","By the time he regained his footing, the Netherworld Sect’s formation had become more than ten times bigger, and the aura it emanated was stronger than his.","Then, the formation’s blood-red aura swiftly contracted, revealing that the Netherworld Sectmembers had broken free from the formation and were now standing neatly behind Chu Feng. The formation eventually converged into Chu Feng’s body.","Chu Feng was cloaked in a blood-colored aura armor that looked sinister but imposing. He had become one with the Netherworld Sect. Above all, the aura he emanated struck fear even in Jie Tianran.","“This isn’t good, Jie Tianran. At this rate, their formation might just reach rank eight Heavenly God level,” the old entity inside Jie Tianran’s body reminded.","“I know.” Jie Tianran could tell as much.","“Then why are you still standing around like a fool? Run!”","“Run? Where am I supposed to go when God’s Era’s power is right before me?”","“Are you going to give up on your life for power?”","Jie Tianran frowned. He knew that he had to make a choice.","Escaping was the safer choice. The Netherworld Sectmembers were expending their life force to channel their formation. They wouldn’t last long at this rate. All he needed to do was to drag things out to secure his victory.","But he feared that something would happen to God’s Era while he was away. In the first place, he still hadn’t grasped why God’s Era had traveled all the way to the Bloodline Galaxy.","He eventually made his choice. There was nothing more important than his life.","Weng!","Just then, God’s Era’s pedestal emanated a brilliant light.","Jie Tianran’s formation had fused into the pedestal. It morphed into a light beam that surged toward God’s Era’s first gate. The first gate began to swirl before exerting a powerful suction force.","“We don’t have to escape anymore.” Jie Tianran was overjoyed.","This was the reason he had expended so many of his talisman papers to construct that formation.","God’s Era had three gates—Jie Tianran had entered the third gate, whereas Chu Feng had entered the second gate. Both of them had avoided the first gate because they knew it was a death trap; those who entered it had no chance of survival.","“This is bad.”","Chu Feng also noticed the anomaly, but the suction force locked onto them before he could bring everyone to safety.","All the Netherworld Sectmembers, including Chu Feng, were dragged helplessly toward the first gate.","“It’s over, Chu Feng.” Jie Tianran laughed triumphantly.","The suction force was so strong that Chu Feng and the others were already dragged into the first gate even as Jie Tianran’s words echoed in their ears.","On the other side of the gate was absolute darkness.","The Netherworld Sectmembers anxiously called Chu Feng’s name, worried that a mishap had befallen him. From their voices, Chu Feng could sense their trepidation.","This place was suffused with a deathly aura, resulting in even their voices sounding different from usual. If hell existed in this world, this would probably be it.","What further unnerved them was the fact that they were likely still in the outer perimeter of this place. An even more terrifying power was lurking in the depths of the darkness. The further they ventured into the darkness, the more concentrated the deathly aura.","There was yet another powerful suction force, but this time, it targeted only Chu Feng.","Before he could react, his body was already lurching toward the depths of the darkness. Helplessness swelled in his heart. He clearly sensed himself drawing close to death, but there was nothing he could do about it.","He didn’t have the means to defy the overwhelming power in this place.","“Am I really going to meet my end here?” Chu Feng felt indignant.","He arrived at the source of the terrifying power.","A brilliant light abruptly vanquished the darkness as his body fell to the ground—or to be more exact, the surface of a water body. Looking down, he saw that he was lying on top of a golden ocean of condensed natural energies.","There was an incomparably colossal palace before him. It was so big that it could have contained the entire world of cultivation.","Chu Feng was stunned. Astonishment and incomprehension gripped him.","He had been here before. This was the Chu Heavenly Clan’s forbidden land.","The last time he was here, a barrier had kept him out. All he could do was to peek at the palace via a window. He couldn’t even approach the palace, let alone enter it.","But now, he was standing at the center of the forbidden land, with the colossal palace right within his reach.","...","A pair of terrifying eyes opened in the Ninth Galaxy, each one comparable to a star.","They belonged to a humongous entity that was larger than an average starfield. Its body was covered in red scales, but it was cloaked in a blue aura that made it seem like a demonic god, domineering and fearsome.","Even its breath could easily cause countless realms to crumble.","Yet, this humongous entity was kneeling even though there was nothing in front of it.","No, that was not it. There was someone in front of it, but the person was so small that he was less than a speck of dust compared to the humongous entity. It was a middle-aged man.","Chu Feng’s father, Chu Xuanyuan.","“Milord, please have mercy on me,” the humongous being kowtowed to Chu Xuanyuan as its deafening voice sent quakes through space.","Chu Xuanyuan smiled faintly as if everything was within his grasp.","“Hm?” He suddenly narrowed his eyes as if having sensed something. Then, he roared, “Shut up!”","Those two simple words carried such powerful might that it felt like it could destroy anything. The humongous entity was so intimidated that it clenched its jaws to keep itself from making the slightest noise.","Chu Xuanyuan’s expression turned grim, and it looked like his consciousness had drifted elsewhere. Moments later, his face lit up in excitement and joy.","“The day has finally come.”"]},{"number":6718,"title":"Chapter 6718: Chapter 6716: The Perfect Inheritor","paragraphs":["Chapter 6716: The Perfect Inheritor","But Chu Xuanyuan’s ravenous joy soon gave way to an unprecedented level of nervousness, as if he was faced with a terrifying enemy.","“Feng’er, you must succeed.”","...","Chu Feng stood before the colossal palace.","Despite its hulking size, he could still see the entirety of the palace, and it evoked an inexplicable sense of familiarity.","Eggy stepped out from the World Spirit Space and said, “Chu Feng, the stars must have blessed you. The treasures inside that palace harness incredible energy. God’s Era’s final power is sealed in there, right?”","Her eyes glowed with excitement.","“Hold on. This looks exactly like how you described the Chu Heavenly Clan’s forbidden land.” Eggy’s expression turned grim. She had only heard about it from Chu Feng, but the image she had of it was identical with what she was looking at right now.","“Yes, this is what I saw in the Chu Heavenly Clan’s forbidden land,” Chu Feng replied.","“Does this mean that the power you have glimpsed in the Chu Heavenly Clan belongs to God’s Era? Is the forbidden land related to God’s Era?” Eggy exclaimed in astonishment.","“That’s what I suspect, but I can’t confirm it.”","Chu Feng’s mind was in disarray. He thought that he was doomed, but he was somehow transported to this place.","“I get it now,” Eggy suddenly declared.","“What did you get?” Chu Feng asked.","“You mentioned before that an activation item is required to obtain God’s Era’s final power, or else attempting to do so will lead to death.”","“That’s right.” Chu Feng nodded.","Chu Feng had given up on God’s Era the first time and dared not enter the first gate subsequently because he wasn’t able to find the activation item.","“But you were able to enter this place safe and sound and reach the end of God’s Era.” Eggy stared at Chu Feng with a smile.","Goosebumps rose all over Chu Feng’s body. “Are you saying that I’m the activation item?”","“That’s right.” Eggy nodded with a smile.","Boom!","The palace doors suddenly opened.","The scenery he saw inside the palace was as vast as the world of cultivation, but it also made his hair stand on end. He saw nine resting lightning beasts, the Sacred Tree Seed, and the Dao Creation Palace. It was his dantian world!","Despite all the storms he had weathered, he could hardly believe his eyes.","Why was God’s Era’s innermost depth the Chu Heavenly Clan’s forbidden land? And why was his dantian world inside the colossal palace?","Even Eggy was stunned. Her agape mouth and widened eyes reflected her shock.","Before Chu Feng could say a word, a familiar voice echoed in the palace.","“Congratulations on coming this far, Chu Feng.”","It was the voice from the God’s Era that he had previously heard, but it was coming from the blue lightning beast of the nine lightning beasts. The blue lightning beast flitted to the entrance of the palace. It emanated a domineering air, but Chu Feng could see the smile on its face.","“Elder, you...” Chu Feng could guess what was going on, but he still couldn’t believe it.","“Don’t be so shocked. It’s exactly what you’re thinking.” The red lightning beast also flitted to the entrance of the palace.","Two of the nine lightning beasts were smiling at Chu Feng.","“Elders, is God’s Era’s final power my bloodline, or to be more exact, you all?” Chu Feng asked.","“That’s right. We are God’s Era’s final power,” the blue lightning beast replied.","“Doesn’t that mean that I received God’s Era’s final power when I was ten?” Chu Feng asked.","“To be more precise, you have received our recognition from the moment you were born,” the red lightning beast replied.","“But if you are God’s Era’s final power, and you are already in my dantian world, why does God’s Era still exist in the world? Does this mean that my power is incomplete?” Chu Feng was confused.","He couldn’t understand why God’s Era’s final power was the legacy in the Chu Heavenly Clan’s forbidden land, or why the Chu Heavenly Clan’s legacy was his Heavenly Lightning Bloodline.","“Hahaha...”","The red lightning beast burst into laughter. It was amused by Chu Feng’s stupefied expression. Anyone in Chu Feng’s place would have been flabbergasted as well.","Eggy stuck her arms on her waist and impatiently grumbled, “Why are you laughing? Hurry up and tell us!”","The red lightning beast looked at Eggy with a doting smile. “Hahaha! What an interesting lass!”","“Stop teasing them. Chu Feng, this can be traced back to the Heavenly Bloodline Sacred Realm. The Heavenly Bloodline Sacred Realm is the cultivation ground for the strongest Heavenly Bloodline, and it happens to be buried in your Chu Heavenly Clan’s forbidden land.","“This matter has nothing to do with your Chu Heavenly Clan; you can think of it as a coincidence. The Heavenly Bloodline Sacred Realm is sentient, and it needs to be nourished by powerful natural energies. The Ancestral Martial Lower Realm happens to be such a place.","“That was why the Ancestral Martial Galaxy regressed from having the most concentrated natural energies in the world of cultivation to the least. The Heavenly Bloodline Sacred Realm has devoured all the natural energies.","“Someone told your father about the Heavenly Bloodline Sacred Realm, so he tried to open it. He soon realized that it is more than just a cultivation land; it contains even greater power—us. He was ambitious and coveted our power, but his cultivation was too low to harness our powers, and he didn’t receive our recognition, either.","“Your father’s extreme methods angered us. We only spared his life because of you.”","Chu Feng was intrigued. “Because of me?”","“You were just born. We chose you because of your powerful Imperial God Tier bloodline.”","“Imperial God Tier? Is that above Saint King Tier?” Chu Feng asked.","He had once tested his bloodline at the Huangfu Heavenly Clan, and the Huangfu Clan speculated that he was at Saint King Tier. That was already the strongest known Heavenly Bloodline.","“That’s right. You were only an infant, but you possessed the strongest bloodline known to the world—Imperial God Tier. That’s why you can harness our powers. You are the perfect inheritor we have been waiting for all this while,” the blue lightning beast said."]},{"number":6719,"title":"Chapter 6719: Chapter 6717: Divine Lightning Enveloping the World","paragraphs":["Chapter 6717: Divine Lightning Enveloping the World","“Hold on. If Chu Feng’s Heavenly Lightning Bloodline is the strongest Imperial God Tier, why didn’t it manifest right from the start? Why was he only able to cultivate after you entered his body? Did his father suppress his bloodline, or did you do it?” Eggy asked.","“Chu Xuanyuan constructed a formation to suppress Chu Feng’s bloodline under our instructions. We didn’t want anyone aside from Chu Xuanyuan to know about this. Even that ape, with whom he is close, doesn’t know the truth. He thought that Chu Xuanyuan sealed Chu Feng’s bloodline to train him,” the blue lightning beast replied.","“I have another question. Imperial God Tier is the strongest bloodline, right?”","“That’s right,” the blue lightning beast replied.","“And you are a Heavenly Lightning Bloodline as well, right?”","“Indeed.”","“What is your tier?”","“We’re also Imperial God Tier.”","“If both you and Chu Feng’s bloodline are at Imperial God Tier, there is no fundamental difference between you two. Why do you have to occupy Chu Feng’s body and suppress his bloodline?” Eggy asked lividly.","“Hahaha!”","Both the red lightning beast and the blue lightning beast laughed.","“You are a straightforward one, aren’t you? I like it! I’ll explain it to you. We were in hibernation when Chu Feng’s father forcefully woke us up. While he is talented, he hasn’t reached the level we require. Naturally, he has to pay a price for that.","“We only spared him because of Chu Feng. You can think of it as Chu Feng repaying his father’s debt.","“But Chu Xuanyuan also understands that the pros of entrusting Chu Feng to us outweigh the cons. There are differences among Imperial God Tier. Chu Feng’s Imperial God Tier bloodline was a newborn like him; it had to grow alongside him. He is bound to encounter hurdles along the way, and we can support him,” the red lightning beast said.","“Your support doesn’t seem much. We still faced so many hurdles in the end,” Eggy scoffed.","“...” The two lightning beasts looked awkward.","“One who seeks to wear the crown has to bear its weight. Some trials are necessary to temper Chu Feng’s mind and willpower, so that he can better wield the Imperial God Tier bloodline, or else he’ll suffer a backlash. Furthermore, there are now two Imperial God Tier bloodlines inside his body, so he inevitably has to go through much more.","“We have informed Chu Xuanyuan about that, which was why he didn’t protect Chu Feng despite having made significant breakthroughs in his cultivation through the Heavenly Bloodline Sacred Realm,” the red lightning beast replied.","“Back when Chu Feng was first born, who was stronger—Chu Xuanyuan or Jie Tianran?” Eggy asked.","“Jie Tianran,” the red lightning beast replied.","“Now?”","“Of course it’s Chu Xuanyuan.”","“How big is the disparity in their cultivation levels?”","“Massive.”","“You’re saying that Chu Xuanyuan could have easily slapped Jie Tianran into oblivion, but he walked away because you all want to temper Chu Feng?” Eggy questioned.","“Well... You can put it like that,” the red lightning beast replied.","“And just to check, Chu Xuanyuan coveted your power, but you scorned him, so he could only tap into the Heavenly Bloodline Sacred Realm for his cultivation,” Eggy replied.","“That’s right. Chu Xuanyuan is talented, but he doesn’t meet our requirement,” the two lightning beasts replied gleefully.","Eggy’s next question caught them off guard. “It sounds like Chu Xuanyuan got the better deal.”","“Ah?” The two lightning beasts couldn’t believe what they were hearing.","“While Chu Feng obtained your power, Chu Xuanyuan got the Heavenly Bloodline Sacred Realm. Chu Xuanyuan’s cultivation surged far beyond Jie Tianran’s during this time, whereas Chu Feng’s cultivation remained beneath Jie Tianran’s. Seems to me that God’s Era is nowhere as great as people put it out to be. The Heavenly Bloodline Sacred Realm is much more useful.”","“...” The two lightning beasts were speechless, but they struggled to refute her.","The red lightning beast turned to Chu Feng and asked, “Is there anything you’d like to ask?”","Eggy’s words were so awful that it would rather talk to Chu Feng now.","“Elders, I’d like to know whether what I’ve been cultivating all these years is you or my own bloodline,” Chu Feng asked.","“It is your own bloodline,” the red lightning beast replied.","“I see. If I may ask, elders, what purpose do you serve?”","“...” The two lightning beasts were rendered speechless once more. Is it our imagination, or does Chu Feng not respect us as much as before?","“Chu Feng, our purpose is to support you. Do you remember when your bloodline went on a rampage at the Sword God Valley? There was no way you could have survived the backlash with your cultivation and body then. If not for our intervention, you would have been devoured by your bloodline,” the red lightning beast replied.","Chu Feng looked slightly placated. At least there is some use to the lightning beasts.","The blue lightning beast added, “Your bloodline skills are also powers we have lent you. The lightning tempering you previously underwent in God’s Era isn’t just a trial; it serves to temper your bloodline skills. Lightning God Bestowment can now raise your cultivation by two ranks.”","“Two ranks?” Chu Feng asked.","“That’s right.” The two lightning beasts nodded.","“What use is that? Stop beating around the bush and tell us straight. How far can you raise Chu Feng’s cultivation by?” Eggy asked.","“There is no shortcut to cultivation. Chu Feng has to do it by himself,” the red lightning beast said.","“What?! What’s the point of God’s Era then? After all the fuss, he doesn’t even make a single breakthrough in his cultivation. Aren’t you just toying with us?” Eggy was enraged.","“ Cough cough . It’s not like we can’t help him at all. We’re about to enter Chu Feng’s body. If he can withstand the lightning tribulation, he should be able to advance to rank one Heavenly God level,” the blue lightning beast said.","“Rank one Heavenly God level? Are you kidding me right now? You granted that old thing Jie Tianran heaven-defying battle power capable of surmounting a cultivation rank, but Chu Feng is only able to advance to rank one Heavenly God level?” Eggy was even more infuriated.","“Chu Feng has been cultivating his own bloodline; we merely play a supporting role. As for Jie Tianran’s heaven-defying battle power, we’re only temporarily lending it to him. It won’t last for much longer,” the blue lightning beast replied.","“Aren’t you just buffing him so that he can beat Chu Feng up? If not for your heaven-defying battle power, Chu Feng would have already crushed Jie Tianran with the Netherworld Sect’s formation. He wouldn’t be acting so smugly out there!” Eggy was so angry that her face turned red.","“Lass, you’re putting us in a bad light. Once Chu Feng advances to rank one Heavenly God level, he’ll recover from his past injuries. Just his Lightning Mark, Lightning Armor, Lightning Wings, and Lightning Aura will raise his cultivation to rank five Heavenly God. If he activates Lightning God Bestowment on top of that, he’ll be able to stand toe to toe against Jie Tianran,” the red lightning beast said.","“That’s right! And it’s not like we didn’t help Chu Feng at all. Do you remember Jie Tianran’s entrance examination and his talk about Chu Feng’s mother? That was the prophecy we gave him. That left him completely embarrassed, no?” the blue lightning beast added.","But Eggy nonchalantly replied, “Sure.”","“You are really...” The two lightning beasts weren’t as charmed by Eggy’s straightforwardness anymore.","“It’s fine, Eggy. I’m sure the two elders have their reasons for doing so,” Chu Feng said.","“Looks like Chu Feng is the more understanding one. Chu Feng, we have been observing you all these years. You might have your selfish motives, but you harbor righteousness in your heart. You show no mercy to your enemies, sometimes even resorting to unscrupulous means, but you are principled.","“You have never taken advantage of your strength to oppress the weak, and you don’t act recklessly when you find a strong backing, either. You are the type of person we require. That’s why we chose to reveal ourselves to you.”","The two lightning beasts looked at Chu Feng and said, “We hereby recognize you and bestow upon you God’s Era’s power.”","With that, the two lightning beasts surged out from the palace into Chu Feng’s dantian.","...","Meanwhile, Jie Tianran was standing in the middle of space. His massive formation shrouded him in a divine halo.","He exhaled deeply and said, “It’s finally over.”","He could no longer sense Chu Feng.","“Jie Tianran, you should retract those forbidden talisman papers. Forcefully enhancing your fighting prowess strains your body,” the old entity inside Jie Tianran said.","Jie Tianran quickly did as he was told.","“Is Chu Feng dead?” the old entity asked.","“I can’t sense him. He must be dead,” Jie Tianran replied.","“There doesn’t seem to be any change in God’s Era. Why did it travel all the way here? Is it because of the phenomenon?”","“That seems to be the case. We’ll know the answer once the phenomenon’s gate opens.”","Jie Tianran set his eyes on the phenomenon’s gate.","...","Meanwhile, Zi Ling and the others were rushing to the Bloodline Galaxy with grim expressions. They had seen Jie Tianran’s massive avatar through an observation formation, and they made out the words ‘Chu Feng’ from his lips.","While Jie Tianran was crossing blows with the Netherworld Sect, it seemed that his opponent was really Chu Feng.","Zi Ling and the others were confused; there was only so much they could pick up through the observation formation. They didn’t have the full picture of what was happening at the Bloodline Galaxy. Even so, they understood that Chu Feng was in danger.","Little Fishy’s eyes hardened with conviction. She was prepared to put her life on the line to rescue Chu Feng.","Just then, deafening thunder boomed.","Everyone from the Chu Clan Alliance looked at the horizon.","...","The previously clear sky of the Ancestral Martial Lower Realm’s Nine Provinces Continent was suddenly shrouded in colorful lights. Those who had been sleeping jolted awake in shock. Many children burst into tears.","Nine-colored lightning had covered the sky.","“This phenomenon...”","It was a familiar sight to those from the older generation. They had seen something similar many years ago, just that this phenomenon was far more intense than that then.","The phenomenon back then had only affected their continent, but this time, it extended to the Ancestral Martial Galaxy, the Nine Souls Galaxy, the Totem Galaxy, the Immortal Sea Galaxy, the Divine Body Galaxy, the Heavenly Dome Galaxy, the Bloodline Galaxy, and the Seven Realms Galaxy.","All beings from the eight galaxies saw the same phenomenon when they looked at the sky—divine lightning raging in heaven. It was a phenomenon that encompassed the entire world of cultivation!"]},{"number":6720,"title":"Chapter 6720: Chapter 6718: Entering Heavenly God Level","paragraphs":["Chapter 6718: Entering Heavenly God Level","Countless realms floated in the vast world of cultivation. Each one emanated a faint light, but they were nowhere near enough to light up the vastness of space. Darkness was the dominant color in endless space.","Yet, space was being overwhelmed by nine-colored lightning at this very moment.","Jie Tianran stood still on the spot, staring at the blinding nine-colored lightning around him. His face was twisted, and his cheeks were twitching. His eyes reflected unprecedented shock.","The world of cultivation was believed to be boundless, but it oddly looked finite when nine-colored lightning filled its entire space.","“Something is wrong, Jie Tianran. That nine-colored lightning carries your grandson’s aura!” the old entity inside Jie Tianran’s body remarked nervously.","“Is that little bastard still alive?” Jie Tianran voiced out his deepest worry.","“Not only so, but he also seems to have made a breakthrough as well. This is the phenomenon that appears whenever he makes a breakthrough in his cultivation. Xianhai Yu’er’s breakthrough induced a phenomenon that enveloped a galaxy. This phenomenon is only stronger than that of Xianhai Yu’er’s. If your grandson has reached Heavenly God level, he might be even stronger than Xianhai Yu’er,” the old entity said.","“Hmph. There’s nothing to fear if that’s all there is to it. My spirit power is comparable to rank seven Heavenly Dragon. Someone who has just reached Heavenly God level can’t be a match for me, unless he can raise his cultivation by six ranks,” Jie Tianran sneered.","“Most prodigies can only raise their cultivation by a rank at Heavenly God level. Even the most talented ones can only raise their cultivation by three ranks. Six ranks? That is unheard of. It is unthinkable,” the old entity said. “But what if he doesn’t stop at rank one Heavenly God? What if he advances straight to rank two or even rank three?”","Jie Tianran frowned. He still wouldn't fear Chu Feng if he had only reached rank two Heavenly God level, but considering Chu Feng’s means, he couldn’t say the same if he reached rank three.","...","Meanwhile, inside God’s Era, Eggy had already returned to her World Spirit Space. Chu Feng was still lingering outside the palace, but his consciousness had entered his dantian world.","He was standing before the two lightning beasts. They didn’t feel as distant as before, especially now that he had a deeper understanding of them.","“I’m surprised, Chu Feng. While I didn’t think you would face any trouble reaching Heavenly God level, I didn’t expect you to accomplish it so easily. Your solid foundation has served you well. You can thank us for that hahaha!” The red lightning beast laughed heartily.","Chu Feng was overjoyed as well. While he had already experienced the power of a Heavenly God through the Monster Slayer Sword and the blue aura, those were external means. It wasn’t the same as wielding his own power.","“Elders, I wouldn’t have been able to reach this level without your help. Thank you.” Chu Feng bowed respectfully.","“Now that you know that your Heavenly Lightning Bloodline is at Imperial God Tier, do you feel that we aren’t of any help to you?”","Chu Feng quickly replied, “Elder, I have never thought that. If anything, I owe you a lot. You have saved me many times. If not for your backing, those who seek to plunder my bloodline would have succeeded a long time ago. I am extremely grateful for your protection.”","He meant those words from the bottom of his heart.","The two lightning beasts nodded, particularly the red lightning beast. It had been watching Chu Feng’s journey and thus understood his character.","However, it chose to maintain some distance, remarking, “Chu Feng, don’t think we’ll help you just because you utter some nice words. I stand by my words. Your bloodline might be strong, but it’s all for naught if you aren’t strong enough to exert its true strength. You need to advance a step at a time steadily. Without a solid foundation, you’ll never reach the peak of the world of cultivation. We’re looking for someone who can do that.","“What awaits you outside is our final trial for you. If you can clear this trial, we’ll divulge our background to you. It’ll allow you to grow even faster when you enter the Ninth Galaxy. If you can’t clear this trial, our support for you will end here. You’ll have to do it on your own from now on.”","Right after the red lightning beast said those words, Eggy raged, “What do you mean by trial? Aren’t you just putting us in a spot?!”","“It’s fine, Eggy. It’s just a Jie Tianran. I’ll slaughter him,” Chu Feng replied calmly.","He had always believed that he could defeat Jie Tianran by himself, which was why he was unfazed when the lightning beasts refused to offer more support to him. Excitement, along with anger, blazed in Chu Feng’s eyes.","“Jie Tianran, it’s time to put an end to our grudge.”","...","Jie Tianran had barely regained his composure when his eyes began quivering anxiously once more.","He noticed that God’s Era’s second gate and third gate had disappeared. Only the first gate remained, but it had receded into God’s Era’s silhouette and turned transparent.","He saw countless figures standing inside the gate—the Netherworld Sect’s army. They were safe and sound, and those who had suffered injuries were all healed up.","Boom!","The nine-colored lightning crackled thunderously, and the surrounding space quaked as if an army of a billion lightning soldiers were marching through the area. The nine-colored lightning had begun converging toward where Jie Tianran was.","Boom!","A nine-colored lightning bolt raced toward God’s Era’s silhouette.","It was so blinding that Jie Tianran had to close his eyes. The ensuing explosion was so loud that it made his ears ring.","When the lightning and ringing finally faded, Jie Tianran hurriedly opened his eyes, only for his pupils to narrow, his mouth to fall agape, and his breathing to hasten. His legs caved in, and he nearly fell on his bottom.","Chu Feng had reappeared in his line of sight, but that was not all. He was sitting on the golden throne, looking at him as if he was a fool being played like a fiddle. The area around the throne was cloaked in nine-colored lightning.","Jie Tianran couldn’t believe his eyes. He sweated profusely despite the coldness of space.","“Could it be that he...”","Despite his disbelief, the facts were laid before his eyes. God’s Era’s aura had assimilated into Chu Feng, and the two had become one. Chu Feng had attained the power of God’s Era.","“He succeeded? Jie Tianran, you fool! You paved the way for your grandson! He only cleared the trial, obtained God’s Era’s final power, and made a breakthrough to Heavenly God level because you dragged him into the first gate!” the old entity inside Jie Tianran’s body roared.","The Netherworld Sectmembers also witnessed the scene.","“Our young master has advanced to Heavenly God level! That’s why we are still alive. He must have cleared God’s Era’s trial!”","They had thought that they were doomed, but in a twist of fate, they had survived the ordeal, and Chu Feng had obtained God’s Era’s final power. This surprise made them lose control of their emotions.","“Impossible! Impossible! There’s no way you could have obtained God’s Era’s final power. It must be a lie. Chu Feng, don’t think that you can fool me like that! I won’t be duped so easily!” Jie Tianran roared as he swung his Demon Slayer Saber at Chu Feng.","Chu Feng did not attempt to dodge the attack, knowing that his safety was guaranteed here.","As expected, the attack unraveled the moment it came into contact with God’s Era’s silhouette. It was unable to breach God’s Era’s defenses.","“How is this possible?” Jie Tianran lost his spirit.","He had been harboring a final sliver of hope that Chu Feng was just putting on a strong front, but he completely lost it the moment he saw God’s Era’s silhouette protecting Chu Feng.","“You still don’t get it, Jie Tianran? Despite having devoted yourself to pursuing God’s Era, you still haven’t figured out what it is? Are you unable to see through it, or are you simply unwilling to face the truth?” Chu Feng looked at Jie Tianran with a mocking gaze.","Even his voice sounded divine, which further confirmed that he had become one with God’s Era.","Jie Tianran’s lips twitched uncontrollably. He had a bad feeling about this, but he still asked, “What do you mean?”","“Jie Tianran, you thought that my father was lowly and unworthy of my mother. That’s why you were so determined to kill my father and me. Let me tell you now that the power you have been pursuing thus far, God’s Era’s final power, is none other than the Heavenly Bloodline inside me.”","The nine-colored lightning around Chu Feng descended from the golden throne, and its brilliance inundated the surroundings once more.","God’s Era’s silhouette morphed into an imposing giant, who, like Chu Feng, looked upon Jie Tianran in contempt."]},{"number":6721,"title":"Chapter 6721: Chapter 6719: The Sinner Who Unravels the Glory","paragraphs":["Chapter 6719: The Sinner Who Unravels the Glory","Nothing could be heard other than the deafening thunder.","Jie Tianran was dumbfounded. He couldn’t utter a word.","Song Changsheng, who was hiding in the distance, murmured under his breath, “To think that God’s Era is Chu Feng’s bloodline. But that shouldn’t have been possible. Isn’t it a power that has existed since the Ancient Era? Chu Xuanyuan, what are you up to?”","He instinctively thought about Chu Xuanyuan whenever something felt off.","...","“Hahahaha...”","Jie Tianran’s stiffened expression finally loosened up. He looked at Chu Feng and sneered in contempt, as if he had seen through him.","“Chu Feng, do you think that you can crush my spirit by coming up with such a lie? You must think that I’m a three-year-old child. Who doesn’t know that God’s Era is a mysterious power passed down from the Immemorial Era, and it has appeared several times during the Ancient Era. How can your bloodline have anything to do with God’s Era?","“God’s Era’s final power towers above everything else. Heavenly Bloodlines are beneath even Divine Bodies, so how can it be even remotely related to God’s Era? I’d still respect you if you beat me fair and square with your newfound power, but you’re resorting to trickery now.”","Jie Tianran didn’t believe Chu Feng’s words. After careful consideration, he was certain that Chu Feng had to be lying.","Just then, God’s Era’s humongous silhouette spoke up, “Jie Tianran, do you remember me?”","Its voice was deep and resonant, like a deity’s. It was the blue lightning beast’s voice.","Jie Tianran was stunned. It was the very same voice that had provided him guidance regarding God’s Era.","“Chu Feng is speaking the truth. You should stop living in a dream.","“Also, I’ll present another fact to you. While I spent most of my time in hibernation during the Ancient Era, I have seen many of its top powerhouses. Chu Feng’s father could have stood at the peak if he were born in the Ancient Era, let alone someone as talented as Chu Feng.","“As for you, others might think that you are talented, but you are beneath my notice. You may doubt me, but you’ll know once you enter the Ninth Galaxy. There are many people of your caliber there, and they are doomed to never reach the peak. It’ll be the same for you as well.","“You might have given birth to an outstanding daughter, but that has little to do with you. Compared to Chu Feng’s father, you are the lowly one,” the blue lightning beast said.","Jie Tianran suddenly lost strength in his legs. He had to stagger a few steps before barely regaining his balance. He clutched his chest in an attempt to calm himself, but in the end, he still spat a huge mouthful of blood.","He looked at God’s Era and spoke with a hoarse voice, “You were toying with me all along. No wonder you told me to organize an entrance examination, saying that the one who gets the first place can aid me in eliminating my nemesis. It was all a trap. You let me claim the upper hand in God’s Era to lull me into a false sense of safety, but you were just playing me like a fool!”","Jie Tianran’s expressions became twisted. Veins popped from his face, and he looked like a ravenous beast.","“Not at all. It was genuine advice on my part when I told you to organize the entrance examination. If you had made the right choice, you would have ushered in an unprecedented era of prosperity for the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion.","“I even gave you a sign after Chu Feng’s identity was revealed, indicating that the person who could bring untold glory to the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion has appeared. The choice was in your hands.","“Think about it. If you had told Chu Feng the truth after learning about his identity and summoned his grandmother and aunt together to persuade him based on blood ties, don’t you think that he would have been more than willing to join the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion? With Chu Feng on your side, your Seven Realms Sacred Mansion would have reached heights previously unthinkable.","“But you were arrogant and stubborn. I have never laid a trap for you. You were the one who made the wrong choice at every turn. It was your selfishness that brought about the downfall of the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion. You are the sinner of the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion,” the blue lightning beast said.","“I see. No wonder Jie Tianran organized that entrance examination, and the first task he entrusted to Chu Feng was to find Jie Ranqing’s child. It turned out that he was following God’s Era’s advice.”","“Is Jie Tianran dumb? Why does he refuse to acknowledge our young master despite having witnessed his talents? Did water get into his head?”","The Netherworld Sectmembers discussed among themselves.","Jimo Qianzhou even shouted, “Jie Tianran, did a donkey kick your head when you were younger? God’s Era has already reminded you, but you still insist on going after our young master. Can anyone really get dumber than that?”","Other Netherworld Sectmembers followed suit and hurled worse insults at Jie Tianran.","But Jie Tianran wasn’t listening to them at all. The blue lightning beast’s words echoed endlessly in his head.","“It’s fine, Jie Tianran. So what if God’s Era is Chu Feng’s bloodline? We’ll just admit defeat for now and teach them a lesson in the future,” the old entity inside Jie Tianran’s body said.","He sensed that Jie Tianran’s emotions were running amok. Anyone in Jie Tianran’s position was bound to suffer a mental breakdown.","Unsurprisingly, Jie Tianran ignored the old entity and instead hissed at Chu Feng, who was sitting on the golden throne on top of God’s Era. “Chu Feng, did you hatch this elaborate ploy just to embarrass me? Very well. You have succeeded. Come at me then! Do you dare?”","Chu Feng was safe as long as he remained within God’s Era. If he chose to step out of God’s Era, he wouldn’t be able to enter it anymore. He would have to resolve this situation with his own strength.","This was God’s Era’s trial.","But even if this was not a trial from God’s Era, Chu Feng wouldn’t have continued hiding inside God’s Era. He wanted to put an end to his conflict with Jie Tianran.","“Jie Tianran, I can kill you without tapping into God’s Era’s power,” Chu Feng said.","“Hahahaha! A mere rank one Heavenly God like you dares to challenge me?” Jie Tianran’s smile warped savagely. He had become so agitated that his expression resembled that of a feral beast.","Chu Feng didn’t bother replying to Jie Tianran’s taunt.","Bzzt!","Lightning Mark.","Lightning Armor.","Lightning Wings.","Lightning Aura.","Unleashing those four means raised Chu Feng’s cultivation to rank five Heavenly God level.","“Our young master is able to raise his cultivation by four ranks in Heavenly God level, just like Xianhai Yu’er!”","The Netherworld Sectmembers were overjoyed. Before Xianhai Yu’er, it was completely unheard of for anyone to raise their cultivation by four ranks in Heavenly God. While they did have their speculations before this, it still filled them with excitement to see it happening.","“But that isn’t enough. Even ordinary rank seven Heavenly Gods are no match for Jie Tianran. How can a rank five Heavenly God possibly defeat him?”","Bzzt!","Two surges of lightning energy, one red and one blue, enveloped Chu Feng’s body. His Lightning Mark, Lightning Armor, and Lightning Wings became more tangible and domineering. On top of that, his cultivation was further raised.","The world fell silent.","The Netherworld Sectmembers were dumbstruck. Even Jie Tianran regained some of his composure.","Song Changsheng widened his eyes in shock. “He raised his cultivation by six ranks in Heavenly God level?”"]},{"number":6722,"title":"Chapter 6722: Chapter 6720: Can You Stop It?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6720: Can You Stop It?","“Am I dreaming?” Baili Xukong rubbed his eyes in disbelief.","His response was dignified compared to the others. Some opened their mouths so wide that one could stuff an egg in them.","It was precisely because they knew they were not seeing things that they were so shocked.","Baili Zilin looked conflicted. He glanced at Chen Hui before shaking his head bitterly. “To think that I even thought about defeating him.”","“Yes, you were very brave,” Chen Hui replied with a laugh.","Jie Tianran stared intently at Chu Feng. He might not have said a word, but the movements of his chest and his trembling hands divulged his thoughts.","“Jie Tianran, you have truly made the wrong call this time. Your grandson is far more talented than that Jie Tian. Do you think he’ll give you a chance if you ask him for mercy now?” the old entity inside Jie Tianran’s body asked.","“My grudge with that little bastard is irreconcilable. Either he dies, or I die. So what if he can raise his cultivation by six ranks? He has only barely reached rank seven Heavenly God level. What do I have to fear?” Jie Tianran replied.","“If so, go ahead and slaughter him. I’m curious to know if God’s Era’s power is any different from other Heavenly Bloodlines,” the old entity said. He supported Jie Tianran’s decision.","Chu Feng took a step out of God’s Era’s silhouette, traversing thousands of kilometers in a single move. With a few steps, he was already standing between God’s Era and Jie Tianran.","As he walked, he reached into his Cosmos Sack and drew his Lightning Flame Sword.","“Jie Tianran, I won’t use any martial skills. I’ll subdue you with just this sword. I shall show you how weak you are when you are at the same cultivation rank as me,” Chu Feng declared.","The crowd was taken aback.","“Isn’t Chu Feng underestimating his opponent too much?” Song Changsheng frowned.","The Netherworld Sectmembers were also worried. They knew that Chu Feng was strong, but Jie Tianran was formidable, too. They had combined their powers with the sacred item’s energy through a formation earlier, but they were still no match for Jie Tianran.","Not to mention that martial skills made a massive difference in a cultivator’s strength. Even a single rank of difference in martial skills could spell the difference between victory and defeat, but Chu Feng chose not to use his martial skills and instead rely solely on his God Armament.","That was courting death!","Jie Tianran understood that, and he felt amused and infuriated at the same time.","On the one hand, he thought it was ridiculous for Chu Feng to impose such a condition on himself. On the other hand, he couldn’t believe that Chu Feng looked down on him so much. He couldn’t stand the contempt directed at him.","“Chu Feng, are you getting ahead of yourself when you have only just reached Heavenly God level? Very well, I shan’t take advantage of you. As long as you don’t use martial skills, I also won’t use my formations and treasures. I’ll only wield this saber. I shall show you that you aren’t a match for me, even when you are the same cultivation rank. In fact, I can defeat you without relying on the means of a world spiritist.”","Jie Tianran unleashed his pure spirit power to enhance his body and his Demon Slayer Saber.","Shoosh!","He took a step forward, and his body morphed into a surge of light that whizzed toward Chu Feng. His movement speed was so fast that it only took an instant for him to arrive before Chu Feng.","Shoosh!","He swung his saber downward to cleave Chu Feng into two.","But Chu Feng had seen through his attack. He held his Lightning Flame Sword horizontally to deflect Jie Tianran’s slash.","Clang!","The two weapons clashed like two colliding comets, producing sparks so bright that they inundated the surroundings. The resulting shockwaves were so strong that they sent Jie Tianran flying into the distance.","It took Jie Tianran a moment to regain his balance. His hands had gone completely numb, and when he inspected his Demon Slayer Saber, his eyes widened in horror.","The Demon Slayer Saber was known as the strongest world spiritist weapon in the world of cultivation, and it was thought to be nigh indestructible. Yet, it had chipped after clashing against Chu Feng’s Lightning Flame Sword once.","He hurriedly looked at Chu Feng’s Lightning Flame Sword—it was undamaged. Chu Feng also stood his ground, not retreating in the slightest.","Chu Feng shook his head and scoffed, “Is that all?”","Jie Tianran’s anger erupted. He charged at Chu Feng once more with his Demon Slayer Saber.","Chu Feng was unfazed. He stood his ground and patiently waited for Jie Tianran to get to him.","Shoosh shoosh shoosh!","This time, Jie Tianran had learned his lesson. He opted for a barrage of swift attacks instead of a single powerful strike. The Demon Slayer Saber vanished amid countless afterimages, sealing off Chu Feng’s path of retreat.","But Chu Feng easily unraveled his offense.","Jie Tianran tried attacking from different trajectories and angles, sometimes even abruptly changing his attack halfway, but somehow, Chu Feng managed to block all his attacks impeccably.","This made him extremely frustrated. He felt like he was always just one step short of defeating Chu Feng.","Shoosh!","After blocking another one of Jie Tianran’s attacks, Chu Feng suddenly changed the trajectory of his Lightning Flame Sword to stab Jie Tianran’s face. His blade was so fast that cold sweat immediately drenched Jie Tianran’s back.","But, with the sharp observation and reflexes he had honed as a world spiritist, Jie Tianran still managed to pull off an evasive maneuver.","Little did he expect Chu Feng to change the trajectory of his sword once more, switching from a stab to a slash targeting Jie Tianran’s neck.","Jie Tianran had no choice but to retreat.","Chu Feng chased him like a relentless phantom. At the same time, he turned his blade toward Jie Tianran’s arm.","This time, there was nowhere for Jie Tianran to escape.","All this happened in the blink of an eye. Before the crowd could process what was going on, blood splattered, and Jie Tianran hurriedly retreated into the distance. By then, his left arm had already been severed.","“Why are you fighting him close up, Jie Tianran? That measly combat skills of yours can’t even match a tenth of his swordsmanship!” the old entity roared furiously.","In truth, he was also caught off guard. He hadn’t dissuaded Jie Tianran from engaging Chu Feng in a physical fight because Jie Tianran was actually extremely skilled in close-quarter combat. It was only after crossing blows that he realized that Chu Feng’s swordsmanship was at an entirely different level.","Chu Feng didn’t continue pursuing Jie Tianran. He stood mid-air while calmly touching his Lightning Flame Sword. “Jie Tianran, I can tell you right now that I’ll be stabbing your left eye next. Can you stop me?”","His words carried confidence as if he were prophesying the future.","By now, it had become apparent to Jie Tianran that he was no match for Chu Feng in terms of weaponry.","Shoosh!","Chu Feng vanished. He morphed into a surge of light whizzing toward Jie Tianran.","“Hmph.”","Jie Tianran harrumphed. He didn’t bother to make any evasive maneuvers. It was only when Chu Feng’s attack was about to land that teleportation energy suddenly enveloped Jie Tianran.","Jie Tianran had invoked a teleportation formation to transport him into the far distance.","GRAR! BOOM!","A humongous formation serpent appeared where Jie Tianran previously stood. It was the massacre formation he had laid beforehand. Seeing the formation serpent swallow Chu Feng whole, Jie Tianran smirked triumphantly.","“Chu Feng, how foolish are you to believe that I won’t resort to formations? At your age, you should have known better not to blindly trust your opponent.”","Right after Jie Tianran said those words, his face suddenly crumbled.","Chu Feng had suddenly appeared before him like a specter, and his Lightning Flame Sword plunged into his left eye."]},{"number":6723,"title":"Chapter 6723: Chapter 6721: He’s Afraid","paragraphs":["Chapter 6721: He’s Afraid","The pain Jie Tianran felt in his left eye was nowhere near as intense as the excruciating pain he felt in his chest. It was as if Chu Feng’s sword had pierced his entire being instead of just his left eye.","He was temporarily plunged into despair, but he swiftly channeled all of that into rage.","“CHU FENG!” Jie Tianran’s roar shook the world.","Spirit power gushed out from his body. He molded it into countless sharp chains that surged toward Chu Feng.","Chu Feng calmly brandished his Lightning Flame Sword while retreating into the distance.","But more and more chains pursued Chu Feng, and they were becoming increasingly thicker. Eventually, they transformed into ferocious formation dragons that unleashed terrifying roars while relentlessly pursuing Chu Feng.","This was not just any simple formation; it was a compounded formation. The more formation dragons there were, the stronger each formation dragon would be.","But Chu Feng easily evaded all attacks, even as the formation dragons grew more numerous and faster. None of the formation dragons had been able to nick Chu Feng.","Baili Xukong and the other neutral elders nervously clenched their fists. They were worried about Chu Feng. Even dealing with a single formation dragon was already beyond them, but Chu Feng was dealing with countless of them.","“Jie Tianran, you despicable old thing! You said that you wouldn’t resort to formations and treasures if our young master didn’t use any martial skills! What does this count as?”","“No wonder you were abandoned by your family! Who can stand someone as shameless as you?”","Jimo Qianzhou, Chen Hui, and the other Netherworld Sectmembers hurled insults at Jie Tianran, though there was no way the latter would be fazed by them. Jie Tianran’s murderous eyes were fixed on Chu Feng.","“Jie Tianran, something is off about your grandson. How is it that we can’t suppress him even when using a formation of this caliber? His God Armament might be formidable, but there has to be a limit to how much it can raise his fighting prowess. Don’t hold back anymore. We need to get rid of him right now!” the old entity inside Jie Tianran’s body said.","Jie Tianran couldn’t even be bothered to respond. There was no way he would still be holding back after losing an arm and an eye. He would have been shredded to pieces by now if he were still holding back.","He channeled the power of his forbidden talisman paper and raised his fighting prowess back to the level as when he was dealing with the Netherworld Sect’s formation.","Shoosh shoosh shoosh!","Chu Feng swung his Lightning Flame Sword, unleashing powerful sword rays.","The sword rays tore through the indomitable formation dragons, silencing the roars and obliterating the formation. The only one who remained standing in the area was Chu Feng and his sword!","“Our young master is a war god!” Cang Li exclaimed in delight.","They would have struggled against the formation dragons even with their earlier formation, but Chu Feng destroyed them with ease. It boggled their minds just how great Chu Feng’s fighting prowess was.","“Our young master is ridiculously strong! Even if a thousand rank seven Heavenly Gods join hands, they still wouldn’t be a match for our young master!” Lie Shan remarked in shock.","“I reckon even ten thousand rankly seven Heavenly Gods wouldn’t be able to nick our young master in the slightest,” Ting Yun said.","“Ten thousand?”","The other neutral elders were dumbstruck. As formidable as Chu Feng’s fighting prowess was, they still thought that Ting Yun’s evaluation was exaggerated.","Quantity could bridge a gap in fighting prowess within the same cultivation rank. It was difficult for a cultivator to defeat a hundred of their peers, let alone a thousand. But Ting Yun went a step further to quote ten thousand.","And Ting Yun was not the type to speak carelessly. His words were well thought through.","Boom!","The surroundings suddenly quaked. All the Netherworld Sectmembers could clearly sense it despite being inside God’s Era.","Space began crumbling from where Chu Feng was.","Immense spirit power had gushed forth like a tsunami, manifesting so many formation soldiers that they resembled a flowing wave from afar.","“What a powerful aura! Can a world spiritist be that powerful?”","The formation was so powerful that the Netherworld Sectmembers felt nervous for Chu Feng despite having witnessed his means. The formation was humongous, and it was moving rapidly. It formed a humongous realm that trapped Chu Feng within it.","The formation soldiers wore golden armor and wielded golden spears, and they emanated a divine light like celestial soldiers. All of them simultaneously raised their spears high and pointed them at Chu Feng.","Jie Tianran formed a hand seal. All the celestial soldiers’ faces warped in ferocity as they hurled their formation spears at Chu Feng at the same time.","But Chu Feng remained unfazed despite the rain of golden spears.","Shoosh!","Chu Feng unleashed a sword ray with a swing of his blade.","With a loud explosion, the humongous realm formed by the countless formation soldiers was cleaved into two. All the formation soldiers lost their support, and they began disintegrating into thin air.","“Impossible!”","Jie Tianran had expended so much energy from channeling the formation that he was bleeding from his nostrils. However, he didn’t have the energy to tend to his injuries. He had believed that this slaughter formation was more than enough to destroy any opponent of the same rank.","It was powerful enough to destroy realms, but Chu Feng cleaved his way out of it with ease.","The Netherworld Sectmembers were in disbelief as well.","“Your judgment is on point, Ting Yun. With our young master’s fighting prowess, even ten thousand rank seven Heavenly Gods wouldn’t be a match for our young master,” Lie Shan said.","“ Cough cough cough ...” Jie Tianran violently coughed up blood.","His face was pale, and he was sweating profusely. In moments, he had become so thin that he looked like a dying person. This was how much the earlier formation had sapped him.","“Is this all you’re capable of?” Chu Feng asked.","“Hahaha...”","The feeble Jie Tianran laughed. His body swayed weakly with each laugh, as if even projecting his voice was strenuous to him in his current condition. He looked deranged.","“Has Jie Tianran lost his mind?” Jimo Qianzhou murmured.","“Anyone in his place would be crushed,” Baili Xukong said.","He was once enemies with Chu Feng, so he couldn’t help but put himself in Jie Tianran’s position and imagine how he would have felt if he were faced against the current Chu Feng. Only one word came to his mind: despair.","“Chu Feng, I might have underestimated you, but I am nowhere near as weak as you think.” Jie Tianran’s eyes gleamed with savagery.","GAHHHHH!","Jie Tianran suddenly let out a deafening roar as tremendous spirit power gushed out from his body like a collapsed dam. His body cracked, and blood seeped out of those lacerations, only to immediately vaporize under the spirit power.","“Jie Tianran, are you out of your mind?! I told you not to hold back, but I didn’t tell you to sacrifice yourself to win this battle! We can always run away if we can’t defeat your grandson right now!” The old entity inside Jie Tianran’s body panicked.","Jie Tianran was attempting to tap into the energy inside the forbidden talisman paper that was usually out of his reach. This was extremely consuming and dangerous, to the point where it could be fatal.","“Oh no! Jie Tianran has a secret hand!”","The Netherworld Sectmembers were unnerved. They noticed that Jie Tianran’s aura had vaguely transcended rank seven Heavenly Dragon to knock on the threshold of rank eight Heavenly Dragon.","“Is this your secret hand, Jie Tianran? Interesting,” Chu Feng calmly remarked.","The contempt he displayed never faltered, no matter what Jie Tianran did. His move shocked everyone.","Clang!","He plunged the Lightning Flame Sword into the folds of space and let go of it. Now weaponless, he flitted toward Jie Tianran.","“Our young master... isn’t even going to use his God Armament anymore? What is he planning?”","Baili Xukong and the six neutral elders dared not believe their eyes. They were unable to comprehend what Chu Feng was up to.","Jie Tianran felt completely insulted and charged at Chu Feng. “You little beast! How dare you look down on me?!”","His spirit power had not exactly reached rank eight Heavenly Dragon yet, but it was now extremely close to it. With the strength he wielded, he was not afraid of confronting Chu Feng in a close-quarter battle, regardless of whether the latter had his God Armament or not.","Uwa!","Jie Tianran was about to make his move when Chu Feng, who was still some distance away, instantly appeared in front of him and hurled a fist right into his abdomen. This powerful strike caused Jie Tianran to spew not just blood but even his saliva as well, and his body shot through space like an arrow.","He flew for quite a while before he barely regained his balance.","“What’s going on?”","Excruciating pain spread from Jie Tianran’s abdomen to the other parts of his body. He couldn’t even summon the energy to stand. It only took one strike from Chu Feng to incapacitate him. He raised his head to look at Chu Feng, but the latter had vanished again.","“Is it that hard to understand?” Chu Feng’s voice echoed from behind.","Jie Tianran anxiously turned his head around and saw Chu Feng standing behind him. The latter looked at him with such a calm gaze that he resembled a deity dictating the fates of those present. This sent shivers down his spine.","“What kind of... monster are you?” Jie Tianran’s voice was hoarse and quivering.","He had been stripped of his pride and conceit; all that was left was fear.","Chu Feng chuckled. He didn’t utter a word, but the aura he unleashed explained it all.","The Netherworld Sectmembers were stunned before cheering in delight. Everything finally made sense to them.","“Our young master has advanced straight to rank two Heavenly God level!” Baili Xukong squealed in excitement."]},{"number":6724,"title":"Chapter 6724: Chapter 6722: Jie Tianran’s Final Hand","paragraphs":["Chapter 6722: Jie Tianran’s Final Hand","“You... concealed your cultivation?” Jie Tianran stared at Chu Feng in disbelief.","Everything made sense to him now. No wonder he couldn’t defeat Chu Feng despite all the powerful means he had hurled out. Chu Feng’s base cultivation was at rank two Heavenly God level, which meant that his maximum cultivation was at rank eight Heavenly God level.","There was no way Jie Tianran could have won this battle in the first place!","“You didn’t notice a thing until I revealed it to you. Don’t you think that your Seven Realms Sacred Mansion doesn’t live up to its reputation as the strongest world spiritist power in the world of cultivation?” Chu Feng looked at Jie Tianran in disdain.","Indeed, Chu Feng had reached to rank two Heavenly God level. That was why the lightning beasts had been surprised; they hadn’t expected Chu Feng to advance his cultivation this far. Similarly, this was the reason Chu Feng dared to confront Jie Tianran with just the Lightning Flame Sword.","It was not arrogance. He was simply that strong.","“Hah...” Jie Tianran laughed with a tinge of bitterness and helplessness.","Chu Feng could finally see his grandfather up close. This was the man who had been hating him before he was even born. For a very long time, his existence had been a heavy mountain weighing on Chu Feng’s heart.","But this man was now kneeling before him. His white hair was unkempt, and his wrinkled face no longer carried anger or killing intent; just frailty. He was like an old man in his final moments, no different from any mortal. He no longer carried the imposing disposition of the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s Mansion Master.","Tears streamed down the corners of his eyes. He could have been regretting his decisions, or maybe he was just feeling self-pity because he was on the verge of death, but he looked pitiful.","But Chu Feng’s eyes carried no pity.","Swoong!","Chu Feng raised his hand. The Lightning Flame Sword flew from afar into his grasp.","“Do it,” Jie Tianran said.","He did not attempt to escape or plead for mercy. He was prepared to face death.","Chu Feng didn’t bother responding. His Lightning Flame Sword transformed into a flash of cold light that swung toward Jie Tianran’s neck.","Pah!","A bony hand shot out of Jie Tianran’s chest and caught the Lightning Flame Sword. This abrupt twist shocked not just Chu Feng but Jie Tianran as well.","“How vicious. You’re going to decapitate even your own grandfather?”","The bony hand emerged from Jie Tianran’s chest with a black world spiritist cloak. The cloak floated in midair even though there were no feet beneath it, as if an apparition was wearing it, but an old gaze could be felt from the cloak’s hood.","It was the old entity inside Jie Tianran’s body.","“Elder, you have recovered!” Jie Tianran was overjoyed. A glimmer of hope returned to his previously lifeless eyes.","“I can’t just watch you die, whether I have recovered or not,” the old entity replied.","Shoosh!","A cold light flashed across the air.","Chu Feng had swung his Lightning Flame Sword and sliced the black world spiritist cloak into tatters. However, the tattered cloak merely turned into an aura that fused back into Jie Tianran’s body.","Jie Tianran floated into the air. A black aura seeped out from him and enveloped his body like armor. He seemed to be undergoing a metamorphosis.","“Chu Feng, it looks like you won’t be able to kill me. I shall show you my final hand.” Jie Tianran was smiling once more, but his expression looked more sinister than ever.","When the black aura fully enveloped him, his gaze suddenly changed as if he had become someone else. At the same time, the black world spiritist cloak that Chu Feng had sliced apart reappeared around Jie Tianran.","A sinister aura rippled through the surroundings, causing everyone to shiver.","“Does a monster live inside Jie Tianran’s body?”","The Netherworld Sectmembers’ hearts skipped a beat. Some even sweated profusely. The sinister aura was so terrifying that they dared not think about opposing it. Even Chu Feng, with his rank eight Heavenly God level cultivation, was no match for it.","In the far distance, Song Changsheng frowned. He noticed that the sinister aura had extended far beyond this area.","...","“This aura...”","The members of the Chu Clan Alliance, who were rushing toward the Bloodline Galaxy, were horrified. Little Fishy, Zi Ling, and the others looked uneasy. Even though the sinister aura had instantly enveloped them, they could still tell that it was coming from the Bloodline Galaxy.","Someone was flaunting his strength, and that person was not Chu Feng.","...","In every populated realm of the eight galaxies, children could be heard crying, and adults stared at the sky in fright. All clouds had dispersed, allowing one to see the night sky clearer than ever.","The sinister aura had permeated every nook and cranny of space. It filled everyone with dread even though it hadn’t dealt any tangible damage.","...","Meanwhile, Chu Feng and Jie Tianran were flitting through space. Their movements were so fast that not even the Netherworld Sect’s Baili Xukong and the six neutral elders could follow them.","The current Chu Feng was shrouded in a golden aura, and his legs were covered in golden runes. He had activated his rank three God Taboo Martial Skills, Heaven Protection and Heaven Footwork.","Yet he still couldn’t keep up with Jie Tianran.","Or to be more exact, the old entity who had taken control of Jie Tianran’s body.","“Kikiki... What immense killing intent. He’s your grandfather. Do you really have to kill him? Have you never thought that your mother will blame you for killing him?” the old entity sneered while dodging Chu Feng’s attack.","He didn’t seem to have any intention of seriously facing Chu Feng.","“Chu Feng, his cultivation surpasses yours. He is at least at peak Heavenly God level, if not beyond that. You aren’t a match for him,” Eggy said.","Chu Feng could tell as much, but it was too late to back down now.","All of a sudden, the old entity suddenly stopped moving.","Chu Feng sensed that it was a trap, but the situation was so dire that he could only take the bait. He thrust his Lightning Flame Sword toward Jie Tianran.","The blade pierced Jie Tianran’s dantian, but Chu Feng’s expression only turned more grim. There was no resistance against his blade as if he had merely stabbed a wisp of smoke.","A pair of bony hands shot out from Jie Tianran’s body at lightning speed. One reached for the Lightning Flame Sword, while the other surged toward Chu Feng’s neck.","Chu Feng unhesitatingly activated Divine Flitting and retreated, putting a huge distance between him and the old entity.","“Interesting. You dodged my attack. Your speed far surpasses that of a rank eight Heavenly God. You are truly a prodigy, Chu Feng. I do regard you highly.","“Jie Tianran might have done things that you find unacceptable, but the people he killed are ultimately outsiders. There is no need for you two to go at each other like rabid beasts. If you’re willing to put down your grudge, I’ll convince him to reconcile with you as well.","“As a cultivator, you harness God’s Era’s power. As a world spiritist, I can offer you guidance. You can be unmatched in the Ninth Galaxy. Even those Ancient Era’s prodigies would be mere stepping stones for you,” the old entity said.","“Outsiders? Is my grandmother an outsider as well?” Chu Feng asked.","“Hahahaha... How do you know for sure that your grandmother is dead?”"]},{"number":6725,"title":"Chapter 6725: Chapter 6723: Using the Eight Galaxies as a Formation","paragraphs":["Chapter 6723: Using the Eight Galaxies as a Formation","The old entity opened up his palm, and a sphere flew out. It was initially minuscule, but it quickly expanded until it became a small realm sitting between Chu Feng and the old entity.","The realm was suffused in a blood aura, but Chu Feng, Baili Xukong, and the others peered beyond the blood aura to see a single individual in there. It was Chu Feng’s grandmother, Jie Nianqing.","“Grandmother?” Chu Feng was surprised.","His grandmother was just a soul entity at the moment, but her aura was stable. Not only was she alive, but she was currently in deep cultivation.","“Jie Tianran might be unscrupulous, but there are people whom he holds dear. There was no way he would kill his wife. He held a public trial because he realized that there was a demonic formation inside her. That formation could metamorphose her bloodline, but it would require her to devour many bloodlines for that to happen.","“Your grandmother was too weak-willed for that, so Jie Tianran staged a public trial to reveal their true faces to her, so that she could harden her determination. He had to be merciless so that she wouldn’t know that he was helping her. Only then would your grandmother, fueled by vengeance, cultivate hard when she realized that she had survived the ordeal.","“When your grandmother finally awakens, she will be able to harness the billions of bloodlines within her and undergo a complete metamorphosis. With that, there is a chance that she might even surpass Jie Tianran in the future. Do you see your grandfather’s kind intention now?” the old entity said.","“I didn’t expect there to be such a side to Jie Tianran.”","“Could it be fake? He can just fake it with a formation, right?”","The Netherworld Sectmembers were surprised to hear the old entity’s words, but at the same time, they also harbored skepticism. But Chu Feng could tell that his grandmother was indeed still alive, and she was advancing in the direction stated by the old entity.","The old entity was not lying about this.","“Chu Feng, have you wondered why Jie Tianran cares so much about your grandmother but harbors such deep hatred toward you?","“I can tell you that Jie Tianran doesn’t care about the other members in the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion—he sees them as mere brutes. However, he is loyal to the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion.","“He once used a divination skill to prophesy the future of the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion. From it, he learned that the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion will face a huge crisis in the near future. Your mother, Jie Ranqing, with her pure Ruler’s Bloodline, is the only one who can help the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion tide through this crisis.","“Your mother must not wed anyone or have any offspring, or else the bloodline purity will be undermined. But she got together with your father and had you. That is why Jie Tianran hates you and your father. He believes that your existence has doomed the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion.","“Later, when Jie Tianran learned that you possessed an extremely pure Ruler’s Bloodline, he was convinced that you had siphoned away your mother’s pure Ruler’s Bloodline. He believes that the only way to put things back in order is to kill you and retrieve your Ruler’s Bloodline. That’s why he has been after your life.","“Others might think that Jie Tianran is heartless, but that is the right thing to do as the Seven Realms Sacred Mansion’s Mansion Master. Can you empathize with your grandfather now?” the old entity asked.","“Empathize my ass,” Chu Feng scoffed.","“Hahaha!” The old entity laughed. “Does that mean that you don’t intend to reconcile with Jie Tianran?”","“Well... I can consider it,” Chu Feng said.","“Oh?” The old entity looked at Chu Feng with gleaming eyes.","Shoosh!","Chu Feng abruptly flitted up to the formation realm, but before he could make a move, the formation realm vanished. It had shrunk back into the size of a bead and was revolving on top of the old entity’s palm.","“Chu Feng, I have grown accustomed to your tricks. I knew that you were aiming for your grandmother. Don’t worry, Jie Tianran won’t hurt your grandmother. She is safer here,” the old entity said as he stowed the formation realm back into his palm.","“I see that reconciliation is out of the question, but what other tricks do you have? Or rather, when do you intend to invoke that power?” The old entity glanced at God’s Era’s silhouette.","“You can scram now if you’re afraid,” Chu Feng said.","The old entity feared God’s Era, but Chu Feng was unable to tap into its powers. If he could, he wouldn’t have wasted his breath entertaining the old entity. All he could do was to put on a brave front in hopes of scaring the other party off.","“Hahaha!” The old entity laughed. “I don’t know why you aren’t using that power, but it doesn’t matter to me anymore. What I told you about your grandmother wasn’t a lie, and Jie Tianran’s motive for going after you is true as well.","“But I did lie about something. I don’t want you to reconcile with Jie Tianran. You are carrying too many good things—the Ruler’s Bloodline, God’s Era, the Genesis Bloodline, and there is also the Four Symbols Divine Body, right? I reckon there are more that the world doesn’t know about. You are a fortuitous encounter I don’t want to miss.","“I spent so long talking to you because I feared God’s Era’s power, but that is no longer the case. I have just completed my formation.”","The surroundings began to quake. All the realms in the eight galaxies began emanating blood-red auras, including the Ancestral Martial Galaxy’s Hidden Dragon Martial Sect.","At the Hidden Dragon Martial Sect, a group of people was gathered before an observation formation—Duan Liufeng, Xia Yan, Li Muzhi, Zhao Shi, Song Xi, Tu Yuanyuan, Chu Lingxi, Xia Yun’er, Li Yue’er, Wuma Shengjie, Kong Tianhui, Kong Ci, Tian Ning, Xian Yun...","They were all observing the situation in the Bloodline Galaxy.","Just then, countless blood-red runes suddenly appeared beneath their feet. There were so many of them that they covered the entire ground.","“What’s that?”","They were all startled.","Blood-red auras rose from the ground and bound them. They struggled, but it was to no avail. To their horror, the blood-red auras began to siphon away their life force.","There was one place that wasn’t affected by the blood-red aura—the Hidden Dragon Martial Sect’s forbidden land. There, a middle-aged man sat on a tombstone, weighing down a coffin lid.","Long Xie glared at the middle-aged man in a mix of fear and fury.","“Ah. You can save your Hidden Dragon Martial Sectmembers, but don’t interfere with other places. I am not done watching the show yet,” the middle-aged man said.","Long Xie’s body jolted. Domineering oppressive might instantly rippled through the Hidden Dragon Martial Sect, removing the blood-red runes and freeing those who were bound by them.","“What was with that aura?”","“Something is amiss. That sinister thing has enveloped the entire world of cultivation!”","Chu Lingxi and the others could see via the observation formation that, other than the Ninth Galaxy, the other eight galaxies had turned blood-red. They were fortunate that Long Xie was here to protect them, but other places didn’t enjoy the same privilege.","Wails of agony and desperate pleas for help could be heard in every realm. It was as if the entire world had been plunged into hell. No matter their cultivation level, their background, or their ages, every living being was enveloped by the blood-red aura and had their life force gradually siphoned away.","Meanwhile, the old entity standing before Chu Feng began emitting a blood-red aura. Even his black world spiritist cloak had turned blood-red.","While the Netherworld Sect’s blood-red aura carried a heavy blood stench, the old entity’s blood-red aura blazed with life force.","“Did that old thing construct a massive formation spanning the entire world of cultivation?”","The Netherworld Sectmembers were stupefied. A colossal formation spanning the world of cultivation was already frightening as it was, but on top of that, energies from the eight galaxies were converging into the old entity, causing his aura to intensify severalfold.","“This is terrible. Chu Feng, hurry up and ask if the Divine Deer can take you to safety!” Eggy urged.","“I have yet to recover my powers,” the Divine Deer said.","This meant that Chu Feng was doomed. As a world spiritist, he could more keenly sense the changes occurring to the old entity. He knew that he had no chance of victory against the old entity.","“Chu Feng, didn’t you ask Jie Tianran about his final hand? I am his final hand. As a world spiritist yourself, do you feel shocked and despair? Isn’t my formation majestic? It spans the entire world of cultivation!”","The old entity opened his arms gleefully like a painter flaunting their masterpiece.","“That’s all it amounts to,” Chu Feng replied.","“Still putting on a tough front, huh? Very well. It doesn’t matter whether you tap into God’s Era’s power anymore, for I am now the true god in this world of cultivation!”","The old entity raised his palm toward Chu Feng. “Chu Feng, I shall gouge out your eyes now. Are you able to stop me?”","He flitted up to Chu Feng like a phantom, and his fingers shot toward Chu Feng’s eyes. It happened so fast that Chu Feng couldn’t react at all. To the others, it was almost as if time had come to a standstill, and the only one who could still move was the old entity.","“Hm?”","Right as the old entity’s fingers were about to reach Chu Feng’s eyes, his smirk suddenly flickered. He should have been able to burst Chu Feng’s eyes with a mere touch, but for some reason, they felt nigh indestructible.","He had failed to gouge out Chu Feng’s eyes.","“It is beyond you to gouge out his eyes,” a voice echoed from behind Chu Feng."]}]);
